#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Canonical dense, sparse and named-variable polynomials for MoonBit, as immutable values and mutable containers."
msgstr "MoonBit 的规范稠密多项式、稀疏多项式与具名变量多项式，提供不可变值与可变容器两种形式。"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:1
msgid "consistency API"
msgstr "consistency API"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/consistency` has no public items: its interface file is empty. It is a whitebox test package that imports both facades and checks that the immutable and mutable layers, and the different representations, compute the same results."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/consistency` 没有公开项：其接口文件为空。它是一个白盒测试包，导入两个门面包，检查不可变层与可变层以及不同表示是否计算出相同的结果。"

#: manual/api/consistency.md:5
msgid "It is listed here because the Luna Flow documentation standard asks for a page per package; there is nothing to call. The checks it performs are described in the [consistency design](../design/consistency.md)."
msgstr "之所以在此列出，是因为 Luna Flow 文档标准要求每个包都有一个页面；它没有可调用的内容。它执行的检查在 [consistency 设计](../design/consistency.md)中说明。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/core` is the shared vocabulary of the library. It owns the exponent-vector monomial type, the named-variable layer, the shape metadata, the capability traits that every concrete polynomial implements, and the operation records used for dictionary-passing generic code. It contains no polynomial storage of its own."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/core` 是本库的公共词汇层。它拥有指数向量单项式类型、命名变量层、形状元数据、每个具体多项式都会实现的能力 trait，以及用于字典传递式泛型代码的操作记录。它本身不包含任何多项式存储。"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
msgid "Both facades, [`immut`](immut.md) and [`mutable`](mutable.md), re-export every type and trait of this page, so most programs never import `core` directly. When you do, give it an alias that does not collide with `Luna-Flow/type_theory/core`:"
msgstr "两个门面包 [`immut`](immut.md) 和 [`mutable`](mutable.md) 都重新导出了本页的所有类型和 trait，因此大多数程序从不直接导入 `core`。若确需直接导入，请为它取一个不与 `Luna-Flow/type_theory/core` 冲突的别名："

#: manual/api/core.md:13
msgid "The examples on this page use that alias. The mathematics behind the items is explained in the [core design](../design/core.md)."
msgstr "本页示例均使用该别名。各项背后的数学原理见 [core 设计](../design/core.md)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:15
msgid "Monomials"
msgstr "单项式"

#: manual/api/core.md:19
msgid "`ExponentVector` is the exponent vector $\\alpha = (\\alpha_0, \\alpha_1, \\dots)$ of a monomial $x^\\alpha = x_0^{\\alpha_0} x_1^{\\alpha_1} \\cdots$. Trailing zero exponents are never stored, so `[1, 0]` and `[1]` are the same value, and the total degree $|\\alpha| = \\sum_i \\alpha_i$ is cached."
msgstr "`ExponentVector` 是单项式 $x^\\alpha = x_0^{\\alpha_0} x_1^{\\alpha_1} \\cdots$ 的指数向量 $\\alpha = (\\alpha_0, \\alpha_1, \\dots)$。末尾的零指数从不存储，因此 `[1, 0]` 与 `[1]` 是同一个值；总次数 $|\\alpha| = \\sum_i \\alpha_i$ 会被缓存。"

#: manual/api/core.md:31
msgid "The value is immutable. Every \"update\" returns a new vector."
msgstr "该值是不可变的。每次“更新”都返回一个新向量。"

#: manual/api/core.md:35
msgid "Builds the canonical exponent vector of an array, removing trailing zeros. The array is copied."
msgstr "由数组构造规范的指数向量，去除末尾的零。数组会被复制。"

#: manual/api/core.md:43
msgid "Returns the empty exponent vector, the monomial $1 = x^{0}$. It is also `One::one()` for `ExponentVector`."
msgstr "返回空指数向量，即单项式 $1 = x^{0}$。它也是 `ExponentVector` 的 `One::one()`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:51
msgid "Returns the stored length: one more than the index of the last non-zero exponent, and `0` for the unit."
msgstr "返回存储长度：最后一个非零指数的下标加一；对单位元返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:59
msgid "Returns the total degree $|\\alpha| = \\sum_i \\alpha_i$ in $O(1)$."
msgstr "以 $O(1)$ 返回总次数 $|\\alpha| = \\sum_i \\alpha_i$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:65
msgid "The degree is a `UInt` sum and wraps modulo $2^{32}$ if the exponents are that large."
msgstr "次数是 `UInt` 求和，若指数足够大，会按模 $2^{32}$ 回绕。"

#: manual/api/core.md:69
msgid "Returns `true` exactly for the unit vector (every exponent zero)."
msgstr "当且仅当为单位向量（所有指数均为零）时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:77
msgid "Returns the exponent of variable `index`; it also serves `v[index]`. An index at or beyond `length()` reads as `0`. A negative index aborts."
msgstr "返回变量 `index` 的指数；`v[index]` 也由它实现。下标大于或等于 `length()` 时读作 `0`。负下标会中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:86
msgid "Returns `Some(exponent)` like `get`, and `None` for a negative index."
msgstr "与 `get` 一样返回 `Some(exponent)`，负下标时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:94
msgid "Returns a new vector with the exponent of `index` replaced by `value`, canonicalized again (setting the last non-zero exponent to `0` shortens the vector). A negative index aborts."
msgstr "返回一个新向量，其中 `index` 处的指数被替换为 `value`，并重新规范化（把最后一个非零指数设为 `0` 会使向量变短）。负下标会中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:102
msgid "Returns `None` for a negative index and `Some` of the `with_exponent` result otherwise."
msgstr "负下标时返回 `None`，否则返回 `with_exponent` 结果的 `Some`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:110
msgid "Returns a fresh copy of the canonical exponents, without trailing zeros."
msgstr "返回规范指数的新副本，不含末尾的零。"

#: manual/api/core.md:118
msgid "Multiplies two monomials by adding exponents pointwise: $x^\\alpha x^\\beta = x^{\\alpha+\\beta}$. It is also the `*` operator."
msgstr "通过逐分量相加指数来相乘两个单项式：$x^\\alpha x^\\beta = x^{\\alpha+\\beta}$。它也是 `*` 运算符。"

#: manual/api/core.md:124
msgid "Exponent addition is `UInt` addition and wraps modulo $2^{32}$."
msgstr "指数加法是 `UInt` 加法，按模 $2^{32}$ 回绕。"

#: manual/api/core.md:128
msgid "Compares two monomials in the library's monomial order: first by total degree, then by the exponent of the highest-indexed variable where they differ, the larger exponent being the larger monomial. This is the graded lexicographic order with $x_0 < x_1 < x_2 < \\cdots$. It also drives `<`, `<=`, `>` and `>=`."
msgstr "按本库的单项式序比较两个单项式：先比较总次数，再比较两者不同处下标最大的变量的指数，指数较大者为较大的单项式。这就是 $x_0 < x_1 < x_2 < \\cdots$ 下的分次字典序。`<`、`<=`、`>` 和 `>=` 也由它驱动。"

#: manual/api/core.md:134
msgid "The order is total, has $1$ as its least element, and is compatible with multiplication: $\\alpha < \\beta$ implies $\\alpha + \\gamma < \\beta + \\gamma$. The [core design](../design/core.md#the-monomial-order) derives these properties."
msgstr "该序是全序，以 $1$ 为最小元，并且与乘法相容：$\\alpha < \\beta$ 蕴含 $\\alpha + \\gamma < \\beta + \\gamma$。[core 设计](../design/core.md#the-monomial-order) 推导了这些性质。"

#: manual/api/core.md:138
msgid "`equal` is structural equality of canonical vectors (it is `==`); `hash` is consistent with it."
msgstr "`equal` 是规范向量的结构相等（即 `==`）；`hash` 与之一致。"

#: manual/api/core.md:147
msgid "Renders the monomial with `x` for variable `0` and `x_i` for variable `i`, and `1` for the unit. Factors are written next to each other without a separator."
msgstr "用 `x` 表示变量 `0`、`x_i` 表示变量 `i` 来渲染单项式，单位元渲染为 `1`。各因子直接相邻书写，不加分隔符。"

#: manual/api/core.md:173
msgid "Named variables"
msgstr "命名变量"

#: manual/api/core.md:177
msgid "`Variable` is a named variable together with its position in the [`VariableContext`](#variablecontext) that created it. Two variables are equal when both the name and the index agree."
msgstr "`Variable` 是一个命名变量，连同它在创建它的 [`VariableContext`](#variablecontext) 中的位置。当名字和下标都相同时，两个变量相等。"

#: manual/api/core.md:184
msgid "You obtain variables from a context; there is no public constructor."
msgstr "变量从上下文中获得；没有公开的构造函数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:188
msgid "`name` returns the variable's name; `index` returns its context-local position, which is also the position of its exponent in an `ExponentVector`."
msgstr "`name` 返回变量名；`index` 返回它在上下文中的位置，这也是它的指数在 `ExponentVector` 中的位置。"

#: manual/api/core.md:197
msgid "Returns the variable's name as a `Luna-Flow/type_theory` `Name`. The index is not part of the result; it is recovered by looking the name up in a context with [`VariableContext::variable_by_type_theory_name`](#variablecontextvariable_by_type_theory_name)."
msgstr "以 `Luna-Flow/type_theory` 的 `Name` 形式返回变量名。下标不包含在结果中；可以通过 [`VariableContext::variable_by_type_theory_name`](#variablecontextvariable_by_type_theory_name) 在上下文中查找该名字来恢复下标。"

#: manual/api/core.md:205
msgid "`compare` orders variables by name, then index (derived); `equal` compares name and index; `to_string` returns the name."
msgstr "`compare` 先按名字、再按下标对变量排序（派生实现）；`equal` 比较名字和下标；`to_string` 返回名字。"

#: manual/api/core.md:215
msgid "`VariableContext` is an ordered, persistent table of distinct variable names. The variable at position $i$ has index $i$, and the names are unique, so names and indexes determine each other inside one context."
msgstr "`VariableContext` 是一个有序、持久的互不相同变量名表。位置 $i$ 处的变量下标为 $i$，且名字唯一，因此在同一个上下文中名字与下标相互确定。"

#: manual/api/core.md:222
msgid "Contexts are compared structurally: two contexts with the same names in the same order are equal, wherever they were built."
msgstr "上下文按结构比较：两个以相同顺序包含相同名字的上下文相等，无论它们在何处构建。"

#: manual/api/core.md:226
msgid "Returns the empty context."
msgstr "返回空上下文。"

#: manual/api/core.md:234
msgid "Builds a context whose variables are `names` in order. It aborts on a duplicate name."
msgstr "构造一个变量依次为 `names` 的上下文。遇到重复名字时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:242
msgid "Like `from_names`, but returns `None` when a name occurs twice."
msgstr "与 `from_names` 相同，但当某个名字出现两次时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:250
msgid "Returns a new context with `name` appended, together with the new variable, or `None` when the name is already present. The receiver is unchanged."
msgstr "返回追加了 `name` 的新上下文以及新变量；若该名字已存在，则返回 `None`。接收者保持不变。"

#: manual/api/core.md:258
msgid "Like `extend_checked`, but aborts on a duplicate name."
msgstr "与 `extend_checked` 相同，但遇到重复名字时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:265
msgid "The old name `extend` is kept as a deprecated alias; see [Deprecated](#deprecated)."
msgstr "旧名称 `extend` 作为已弃用的别名保留；参见[已弃用](#deprecated)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:269
msgid "`size` returns the number of variables; `variables` returns them in index order as a fresh array; `get` returns the variable at an index, or `None` outside `0 ..< size()`."
msgstr "`size` 返回变量个数；`variables` 以下标顺序返回所有变量组成的新数组；`get` 返回某个下标处的变量，下标超出 `0 ..< size()` 时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:279
msgid "`variable` looks a variable up by name and returns `None` when it is absent; `require_variable` aborts instead. Lookup is a linear scan."
msgstr "`variable` 按名字查找变量，不存在时返回 `None`；`require_variable` 则会中止（abort）。查找是线性扫描。"

#: manual/api/core.md:288
msgid "Returns `true` when the context's variable at `variable.index()` equals `variable`. A variable from a structurally equal context is therefore contained as well."
msgstr "当上下文中位于 `variable.index()` 的变量等于 `variable` 时返回 `true`。因此，来自结构相等的上下文的变量同样被视为包含在内。"

#: manual/api/core.md:296
msgid "Resolves a `type_theory` `Name` to the variable with the same text, or `None`."
msgstr "把 `type_theory` 的 `Name` 解析为同名文本的变量，否则返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:302
msgid "For every variable `v` of a context `c`, `c.variable_by_type_theory_name(v.to_type_theory_name()) == Some(v)`."
msgstr "对上下文 `c` 的每个变量 `v`，都有 `c.variable_by_type_theory_name(v.to_type_theory_name()) == Some(v)`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:306
msgid "Like `variable_by_type_theory_name`, but aborts when the name is unknown."
msgstr "与 `variable_by_type_theory_name` 相同，但名字未知时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:314
msgid "Structural equality, also available as `==`."
msgstr "结构相等，也可通过 `==` 使用。"

#: manual/api/core.md:339
msgid "Shapes"
msgstr "形状"

#: manual/api/core.md:343
msgid "`PolynomialShape` describes the dimensions of a polynomial without its coefficients. Construct it with the snake-case functions below or with the constructors."
msgstr "`PolynomialShape` 描述多项式的维度信息，不含其系数。可以用下面的蛇形命名函数或构造器来构造它。"

#: manual/api/core.md:354
msgid "`length` is the number of stored coefficients of a dense polynomial, `arity` the number of variables in use (the longest exponent vector), and `term_count` the number of non-zero terms."
msgstr "`length` 是稠密多项式存储的系数个数，`arity` 是使用中的变量个数（最长指数向量的长度），`term_count` 是非零项的个数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:358
msgid "Build the three shapes."
msgstr "构造这三种形状。"

#: manual/api/core.md:368
msgid "Returns the arity; a univariate shape has arity `1`."
msgstr "返回元数；单变量形状的元数为 `1`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:376
msgid "Returns the term count, or `None` for a univariate shape, which does not record it."
msgstr "返回项数；对单变量形状返回 `None`，因为它不记录项数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:384
msgid "Returns `true` when values of the two shapes may be combined: two univariate shapes, two multivariate shapes, or two contextual shapes over equal contexts. Arity and term count are ignored."
msgstr "当两种形状的值可以组合时返回 `true`：两个单变量形状、两个多变量形状，或基于相等上下文的两个上下文形状。元数和项数不参与判断。"

#: manual/api/core.md:392
msgid "Returns `Some(())` when the shapes are compatible and `None` otherwise, for use in `Option` pipelines."
msgstr "形状相容时返回 `Some(())`，否则返回 `None`，便于在 `Option` 管道中使用。"

#: manual/api/core.md:412
#: manual/api/immut.md:73
#: manual/api/mutable.md:73
msgid "Capability traits"
msgstr "能力 trait"

#: manual/api/core.md:414
msgid "The capability traits are small, open traits (`pub(open)`) that state one observable property each. The bundle traits combine them into what generic code usually asks for. All concrete polynomial types of the library implement the bundles listed in this table:"
msgstr "能力 trait 是小型的开放 trait（`pub(open)`），每个只陈述一种可观察的性质。组合 trait 把它们组合成泛型代码通常需要的约束。本库的所有具体多项式类型都实现了下表列出的组合 trait："

#: manual/api/core.md:416
msgid "Trait"
msgstr "Trait"

#: manual/api/core.md:416
msgid "Required methods / supertraits"
msgstr "必需方法 / 父 trait"

#: manual/api/core.md:416
msgid "Implemented by"
msgstr "实现者"

#: manual/api/core.md:421
msgid "every `mutable` container"
msgstr "所有 `mutable` 容器"

#: manual/api/core.md:425
msgid "The number of stored coefficients of a dense polynomial; `0` for zero."
msgstr "稠密多项式存储的系数个数；零多项式为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:435
msgid "The degree of a univariate polynomial, `None` for the zero polynomial."
msgstr "单变量多项式的次数，零多项式为 `None`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:445
msgid "Whether the value is the zero polynomial. In canonical form this is \"has no stored terms\"."
msgstr "该值是否为零多项式。在规范形式下即“没有存储任何项”。"

#: manual/api/core.md:455
msgid "The number of non-zero terms."
msgstr "非零项的个数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:465
msgid "The number of variables in use: the maximum `ExponentVector::length` over all terms, `0` for constants."
msgstr "使用中的变量个数：所有项的 `ExponentVector::length` 的最大值，常数为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:475
msgid "The maximum total degree over all terms, `None` for zero."
msgstr "所有项的最大总次数，零多项式为 `None`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:485
msgid "The variable context a polynomial is bound to."
msgstr "多项式所绑定的变量上下文。"

#: manual/api/core.md:495
msgid "The [`PolynomialShape`](#polynomialshape) of a value."
msgstr "值的 [`PolynomialShape`](#polynomialshape)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:505
msgid "Resets a mutable container to zero in place."
msgstr "将可变容器原地重置为零。"

#: manual/api/core.md:515
msgid "Returns an independent copy of a mutable container: later mutation of either value does not affect the other."
msgstr "返回可变容器的独立副本：此后修改其中任一个值都不会影响另一个。"

#: manual/api/core.md:525
msgid "Bundle for dense univariate polynomials."
msgstr "稠密单变量多项式的组合 trait。"

#: manual/api/core.md:534
msgid "Bundle for index-addressed multivariate polynomials."
msgstr "按下标寻址的多变量多项式的组合 trait。"

#: manual/api/core.md:543
msgid "Bundle for polynomials bound to a `VariableContext`."
msgstr "绑定到 `VariableContext` 的多项式的组合 trait。"

#: manual/api/core.md:552
msgid "Bundle for mutable containers."
msgstr "可变容器的组合 trait。"

#: manual/api/core.md:576
msgid "Inside a function with a multi-trait bound, call trait methods in the qualified form `Trait::method(value)`, as above."
msgstr "在带有多 trait 约束的函数中，请像上面那样以限定形式 `Trait::method(value)` 调用 trait 方法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:578
msgid "Operation records"
msgstr "操作记录"

#: manual/api/core.md:580
msgid "MoonBit traits have only the `Self` type parameter, so a trait cannot say \"a polynomial type `P` with coefficient type `A`\". The operation records fill that gap: each concrete type returns a record of functions from its `ops()` method, and generic code receives the record as an ordinary argument. The accessor methods call the stored functions; they add no behaviour of their own."
msgstr "MoonBit 的 trait 只有 `Self` 这一个类型参数，因此 trait 无法表达“系数类型为 `A` 的多项式类型 `P`”。操作记录弥补了这一缺口：每个具体类型通过其 `ops()` 方法返回一个函数记录，泛型代码把该记录作为普通参数接收。各访问器方法只调用所存储的函数，不添加任何自身行为。"

#: manual/api/core.md:584
msgid "Operations of a univariate polynomial type `P` with coefficients `A`."
msgstr "系数为 `A` 的单变量多项式类型 `P` 的操作。"

#: manual/api/core.md:591
msgid "`new` takes, in order: `zero`, `one`, `from_coefficients`, `to_coefficients`, `coefficient`, `coefficient_checked`, `eval`, `add`, `mul`, `scale`, `scale_checked` and `pow`, with the meanings of the [`DensePolynomial`](immut/dense.md) methods of the same names. Use it to wrap your own univariate type."
msgstr "`new` 依次接收：`zero`、`one`、`from_coefficients`、`to_coefficients`、`coefficient`、`coefficient_checked`、`eval`、`add`、`mul`、`scale`、`scale_checked` 和 `pow`，含义与 [`DensePolynomial`](immut/dense.md) 的同名方法相同。可用它包装你自己的单变量类型。"

#: manual/api/core.md:593
msgid "`UnivariateOps` accessors"
msgstr "`UnivariateOps` 访问器"

#: manual/api/core.md:595
msgid "Each accessor applies the corresponding stored function."
msgstr "每个访问器调用对应的存储函数。"

#: manual/api/core.md:614
msgid "Operations of an index-addressed multivariate polynomial type `P` with coefficients `A`."
msgstr "系数为 `A` 的按下标寻址多变量多项式类型 `P` 的操作。"

#: manual/api/core.md:621
msgid "`new` takes, in order: `zero`, `one`, `from_terms`, `to_terms`, `eval_indexed`, `eval_indexed_checked`, `add`, `mul`, `scale` and `pow`. `eval_indexed` is the `eval` method of [`TermPolynomial`](immut/term.md) and [`SparsePolynomial`](immut/sparse.md)."
msgstr "`new` 依次接收：`zero`、`one`、`from_terms`、`to_terms`、`eval_indexed`、`eval_indexed_checked`、`add`、`mul`、`scale` 和 `pow`。`eval_indexed` 即 [`TermPolynomial`](immut/term.md) 与 [`SparsePolynomial`](immut/sparse.md) 的 `eval` 方法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:623
msgid "`MultivariateOps` accessors"
msgstr "`MultivariateOps` 访问器"

#: manual/api/core.md:640
msgid "Operations of a context-bound polynomial type `P` with coefficients `A`."
msgstr "系数为 `A` 的上下文绑定多项式类型 `P` 的操作。"

#: manual/api/core.md:647
msgid "`new` takes, in order: `from_terms`, `to_terms`, `eval_named_checked`, `add_checked` and `mul_checked`, with the meanings of the [`ContextPolynomial`](immut/context.md) methods."
msgstr "`new` 依次接收：`from_terms`、`to_terms`、`eval_named_checked`、`add_checked` 和 `mul_checked`，含义与 [`ContextPolynomial`](immut/context.md) 的对应方法相同。"

#: manual/api/core.md:649
msgid "`ContextOps` accessors"
msgstr "`ContextOps` 访问器"

