#: manual/api/immut.md:1
msgid "immut API"
msgstr "immut API"

#: manual/api/immut.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut` is the facade of the immutable polynomial layer. It defines nothing of its own: it re-exports the shared [`core`](core.md) vocabulary, the common algebra traits of `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`, and the four immutable representations, so one import gives access to the whole value-oriented API."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut` 是不可变多项式层的门面包。它自身不定义任何内容：它重新导出共享的 [`core`](core.md) 词汇、`Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 的通用代数 trait 以及四种不可变表示，因此一次导入即可访问整个面向值的 API。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:11
msgid "Every name below is a `pub using` alias: `@immut.DensePolynomial` *is* `@immut/dense.DensePolynomial`, and `@immut.ExponentVector` *is* `@core.ExponentVector`. Methods are documented on the page of the package that defines the type."
msgstr "下列每个名字都是 `pub using` 别名：`@immut.DensePolynomial` *就是* `@immut/dense.DensePolynomial`，`@immut.ExponentVector` *就是* `@core.ExponentVector`。方法在定义该类型的包的页面中说明。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:13
#: manual/api/mutable.md:13
msgid "Polynomial types"
msgstr "多项式类型"

#: manual/api/immut.md:17
msgid "Immutable dense univariate polynomial. See the [immut/dense API](immut/dense.md)."
msgstr "不可变稠密一元多项式。参见 [immut/dense API](immut/dense.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:25
msgid "Immutable multivariate polynomial as a sorted term array. See the [immut/term API](immut/term.md)."
msgstr "以有序项数组表示的不可变多元多项式。参见 [immut/term API](immut/term.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:33
msgid "Immutable multivariate polynomial as an ordered map. See the [immut/sparse API](immut/sparse.md)."
msgstr "以有序映射表示的不可变多元多项式。参见 [immut/sparse API](immut/sparse.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:41
msgid "Immutable polynomial over a named-variable context, and the payload of its substitutions. See the [immut/context API](immut/context.md)."
msgstr "具名变量上下文上的不可变多项式，以及其代换的载荷。参见 [immut/context API](immut/context.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:48
msgid "The alias re-exports the type, not its constructors as standalone values: write `Scalar(v)` and `Polynomial(p)` where the expected type is known, or `@immut.ContextSubstitutionValue::Polynomial(p)` in full."
msgstr "别名重新导出的是类型，而不是作为独立值的构造器：在期望类型已知时写 `Scalar(v)` 和 `Polynomial(p)`，否则写全称 `@immut.ContextSubstitutionValue::Polynomial(p)`。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:50
#: manual/api/mutable.md:50
msgid "Shared vocabulary from `core`"
msgstr "来自 `core` 的共享词汇"

#: manual/api/immut.md:54
#: manual/api/mutable.md:54
msgid "Monomials, named variables, variable contexts and shape metadata. See the [core API](core.md)."
msgstr "单项式、具名变量、变量上下文和形状元数据。参见 [core API](core.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:65
#: manual/api/mutable.md:65
msgid "Operation records for dictionary-passing generic code. See the [core API](core.md#operation-records)."
msgstr "用于字典传递式泛型代码的操作记录。参见 [core API](core.md#operation-records)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:75
#: manual/api/mutable.md:75
msgid "The observation traits and their bundles. See the [core API](core.md#capability-traits)."
msgstr "观察 trait 及其组合。参见 [core API](core.md#capability-traits)。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:94
msgid "`Clearable`, `Copyable` and `MutablePolynomial` are re-exported here as well so that both facades export the same trait set, although no immutable type implements them."
msgstr "这里同样重新导出了 `Clearable`、`Copyable` 和 `MutablePolynomial`，以便两个门面包导出相同的 trait 集合，尽管没有任何不可变类型实现它们。"

#: manual/api/immut.md:96
#: manual/api/mutable.md:96
msgid "Algebra traits from `luna-generic`"
msgstr "来自 `luna-generic` 的代数 trait"

#: manual/api/immut.md:100
#: manual/api/mutable.md:100
msgid "The algebraic capability traits of [`Luna-Flow/luna-generic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/), re-exported so that coefficient bounds can be written without a second import."
msgstr "[`Luna-Flow/luna-generic`](https://lunaflow.cn/en/luna-generic/) 的代数能力 trait，重新导出后，书写系数约束无需第二次导入。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:1
msgid "immut/context API"
msgstr "immut/context API"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/context` provides `ContextPolynomial[A]`, an immutable multivariate polynomial bound to a [`VariableContext`](../core.md#variablecontext). Terms refer to variables by name through the context, and the package adds named evaluation, partial evaluation and simultaneous substitution of variables by scalars or polynomials, including by `Luna-Flow/type_theory` names."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/context` 提供 `ContextPolynomial[A]`，即绑定到 [`VariableContext`](../core.md#variablecontext) 的不可变多变量多项式。各项通过上下文按名字引用变量；该包还提供按名字求值、部分求值，以及用标量或多项式对变量进行同时代换（也支持 `Luna-Flow/type_theory` 名字）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:5
msgid "The polynomial is stored either as a [`TermPolynomial`](term.md) or as a [`SparsePolynomial`](sparse.md); you choose when you build it, and the choice affects cost, not results. The types are re-exported by the [`immut`](../immut.md) facade, which the examples use. The mathematics of substitution is in the [immut/context design](../../design/immut/context.md)."
msgstr "多项式以 [`TermPolynomial`](term.md) 或 [`SparsePolynomial`](sparse.md) 形式存储；由你在构造时选择，这一选择只影响开销，不影响结果。这些类型由 [`immut`](../immut.md) 门面包重新导出，示例即使用该门面包。代换的数学原理见 [immut/context 设计](../../design/immut/context.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:7
msgid "Most operations come in pairs: the plain form aborts on a contract violation, and the `*_checked` form returns `None` instead. The contract violations are listed with each item."
msgstr "大多数操作成对出现：普通形式在违反契约时中止（abort），而 `*_checked` 形式改为返回 `None`。各项都列出了相应的契约违反情形。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:9
#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:7
msgid "Types"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:13
msgid "A polynomial in the variables of a context $\\Gamma$, together with $\\Gamma$ itself."
msgstr "上下文 $\\Gamma$ 中变量的多项式，连同 $\\Gamma$ 本身。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:30
msgid "There is no `Eq` instance; compare `to_terms()` (and `context()`) instead."
msgstr "没有 `Eq` 实例；请改为比较 `to_terms()`（以及 `context()`）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:34
msgid "The replacement for one variable in a substitution: a coefficient or a polynomial over the same context."
msgstr "代换中某一变量的替换值：一个系数，或同一上下文上的多项式。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:43
msgid "The constructors are type-directed, so inside a substitution list you can write `Scalar(2)` and `Polynomial(q)` without qualification."
msgstr "构造器是类型导向的，因此在代换列表中可以直接写 `Scalar(2)` 和 `Polynomial(q)`，无需限定。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:45
#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:32
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:32
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:31
msgid "Construction"
msgstr "构造"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:49
msgid "Build a polynomial from named terms, each a list of `(variable, exponent)` factors and a coefficient, stored as a term array or as a sparse map. Repeated factors of one variable add their exponents, and equal monomials merge. They abort when a factor uses a variable outside the context."
msgstr "由命名项构造多项式，每一项是一组 `(variable, exponent)` 因子和一个系数，存储为项数组或稀疏映射。同一变量的重复因子会将指数相加，相等的单项式会合并。当某个因子使用了上下文之外的变量时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:58
msgid "Like the above, returning `None` when a factor uses a variable that the context does not contain."
msgstr "与上面相同，但当某个因子使用了上下文中不包含的变量时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:67
msgid "Bind an index-addressed polynomial to a context: variable $i$ of the polynomial becomes the context's variable with index $i$."
msgstr "将按下标寻址的多项式绑定到上下文：多项式的变量 $i$ 成为上下文中下标为 $i$ 的变量。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:74
msgid "[!WARNING] These two constructors do not check that the polynomial's arity is at most `context.size()`. If it is larger, `eval_named`, `eval_named_checked` and `to_string` abort with an index error instead of returning `None`. Check `polynomial.arity() <= context.size()` before calling them with untrusted input."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 这两个构造器不检查多项式的元数是否不超过 `context.size()`。若超过，`eval_named`、`eval_named_checked` 和 `to_string` 会因下标错误而中止（abort），而不是返回 `None`。对不可信输入调用它们之前，请先检查 `polynomial.arity() <= context.size()`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:79
msgid "The constant polynomial $c$ over a context, stored sparse."
msgstr "上下文上的常数多项式 $c$，以稀疏形式存储。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:87
msgid "The polynomial consisting of one variable of the context, stored sparse. It aborts when the context does not contain the variable."
msgstr "由上下文中的一个变量构成的多项式，以稀疏形式存储。当上下文不包含该变量时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:95
msgid "Like `variable`, returning `None` for a variable outside the context."
msgstr "与 `variable` 相同，但变量不在上下文中时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:121
#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:91
msgid "Queries and conversion"
msgstr "查询与转换"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:125
msgid "Returns the context the polynomial is bound to."
msgstr "返回多项式所绑定的上下文。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:133
msgid "Returns the index-addressed terms in the order of the storage: descending for term storage, ascending for sparse storage."
msgstr "按存储顺序返回按下标寻址的项：项存储为降序，稀疏存储为升序。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:141
msgid "Return the polynomial in the requested index-addressed storage, converting if needed. The context is dropped."
msgstr "以所请求的按下标寻址存储形式返回该多项式，必要时进行转换。上下文会被丢弃。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:150
msgid "The number of terms, the number of variables in use (the highest used index plus one), whether there are no terms, and `PolynomialShape::Contextual(context~, arity~, term_count~)`."
msgstr "项数、使用中的变量个数（所用的最大下标加一）、是否没有任何项，以及 `PolynomialShape::Contextual(context~, arity~, term_count~)`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:161
msgid "Renders the terms in storage order as `c * x^2 * y`, using the context's variable names; zero prints as the coefficient zero."
msgstr "使用上下文中的变量名，按存储顺序把各项渲染为 `c * x^2 * y` 的形式；零多项式打印为系数零。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:167
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:195
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:190
msgid "Evaluation"
msgstr "求值"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:171
msgid "Evaluates with values given by index, like `TermPolynomial::eval`: `values[i]` is the value of the context's variable $i$. It aborts when `values.length() < arity()`."
msgstr "按下标给出取值进行求值，与 `TermPolynomial::eval` 相同：`values[i]` 是上下文中变量 $i$ 的取值。当 `values.length() < arity()` 时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:179
msgid "Like `eval`, returning `None` when `values` is shorter than `arity()`."
msgstr "与 `eval` 相同，但当 `values` 短于 `arity()` 时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:187
msgid "Evaluates with values given by variable. Every context variable with index below `arity()` must be assigned exactly once; assignments to later variables of the context are accepted and ignored. It aborts on a variable outside the context, a missing assignment, or a duplicate assignment."
msgstr "按变量给出取值进行求值。上下文中下标小于 `arity()` 的每个变量都必须恰好赋值一次；对上下文中更靠后的变量的赋值会被接受并忽略。遇到上下文之外的变量、缺失的赋值或重复的赋值时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:195
msgid "Like `eval_named`, returning `None` in the same situations."
msgstr "与 `eval_named` 相同，但在同样的情形下返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:214
msgid "Partial evaluation and substitution"
msgstr "部分求值与代换"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:216
msgid "All forms below return a polynomial over the *same* context; assigned variables simply no longer occur in it. Replacements are applied simultaneously, in one pass: replacement polynomials are not substituted into again."
msgstr "下面的所有形式都返回*同一*上下文上的多项式；被赋值的变量只是不再出现在其中。替换是同时进行的，一遍完成：替换多项式本身不会再被代换。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:220
msgid "Replaces each listed variable by a scalar or by a polynomial over an equal context, leaving unlisted variables unchanged. It aborts when a variable is outside the context, a variable is listed twice, or a replacement polynomial has a different context."
msgstr "把列出的每个变量替换为标量或基于相等上下文的多项式，未列出的变量保持不变。当变量不在上下文中、某变量被列出两次，或替换多项式的上下文不同时中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:228
msgid "Like `substitute`, returning `None` in the same situations."
msgstr "与 `substitute` 相同，但在同样的情形下返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:236
msgid "Like `substitute`, with variables named by `Luna-Flow/type_theory` `Name` values, resolved in the polynomial's context. It also aborts when a name is not in the context; two entries with the same name count as a duplicate."
msgstr "与 `substitute` 相同，但变量以 `Luna-Flow/type_theory` 的 `Name` 值指定，并在多项式的上下文中解析。当名字不在上下文中时也会中止（abort）；两个同名条目视为重复。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:244
msgid "Like `substitute_names`, returning `None` in the same situations."
msgstr "与 `substitute_names` 相同，但在同样的情形下返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:252
msgid "Substitute scalars for some variables: `eval_partial(a)` is `substitute` with every value wrapped in `Scalar`, with the same failure cases."
msgstr "对部分变量代入标量：`eval_partial(a)` 就是把每个值包装为 `Scalar` 后的 `substitute`，失败情形相同。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:261
msgid "The same with `type_theory` names: `substitute_names` with scalar values."
msgstr "使用 `type_theory` 名字的同类操作：以标量为值的 `substitute_names`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:268
msgid "The result of every substitution is stored sparse, whatever the input storage."
msgstr "无论输入采用何种存储，每次代换的结果都以稀疏形式存储。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:286
#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:178
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:150
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:143
msgid "Arithmetic"
msgstr "算术"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:290
msgid "The operators `+`, `-`, `*` and unary `-`. Binary operators abort when the two contexts differ. Two term-stored operands give a term-stored result, two sparse ones a sparse result, and mixed operands a sparse result. Negation keeps the storage."
msgstr "运算符 `+`、`-`、`*` 和一元 `-`。当两个上下文不同时，二元运算符会中止（abort）。两个项存储的操作数得到项存储的结果，两个稀疏操作数得到稀疏结果，混合操作数得到稀疏结果。取负保持存储形式不变。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:301
msgid "Like `+` and `*`, returning `None` when the contexts differ."
msgstr "与 `+` 和 `*` 相同，但上下文不同时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:310
msgid "Returns $p^e$ in the same storage; `pow(0)` is the constant one."
msgstr "以相同存储形式返回 $p^e$；`pow(0)` 是常数一。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:329
#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:319
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:232
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:235
msgid "Generic access"
msgstr "泛型访问"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:333
msgid "Returns the [`ContextOps`](../core.md#contextops) record: `from_terms` builds a term-stored polynomial, and `eval_named_checked`, `add_checked` and `mul_checked` are the methods above."
msgstr "返回 [`ContextOps`](../core.md#contextops) 记录：`from_terms` 构造项存储的多项式，`eval_named_checked`、`add_checked` 和 `mul_checked` 即上面的方法。"

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:351
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:256
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:268
#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:211
#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:217
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:193
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:185
msgid "Hidden method forms kept for source compatibility:"
msgstr "为源码兼容而保留的隐藏方法形式："

#: manual/api/immut/context.md:356
#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:346
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:262
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:274
#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:216
#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:224
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:199
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:191
msgid "`Repr(p)` or `debug_inspect`"
msgstr "`Repr(p)` 或 `debug_inspect`"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:1
msgid "immut/dense API"
msgstr "immut/dense API"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/dense` provides `DensePolynomial[A]`, an immutable univariate polynomial stored as its ascending coefficient vector. Every operation returns a new value in canonical form: no trailing zero coefficients, and the zero polynomial stored as an empty vector."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/dense` 提供 `DensePolynomial[A]`：一种不可变的一元多项式，以升幂系数向量存储。每个操作都返回规范形式的新值：没有末尾的零系数，零多项式存储为空向量。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:5
msgid "The type is re-exported by the [`immut`](../immut.md) facade as `@immut.DensePolynomial`, which the examples use. The algorithms and their costs are explained in the [immut/dense design](../../design/immut/dense.md)."
msgstr "该类型由 [`immut`](../immut.md) 门面包重新导出为 `@immut.DensePolynomial`，示例中使用的就是它。算法及其代价见 [immut/dense 设计](../../design/immut/dense.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:7
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:7
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:7
#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:7
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:7
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:7
msgid "The type"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:11
msgid ""
"`DensePolynomial[A]` represents $c_0 + c_1 x + \\dots + c_{n-1} x^{n-1}$ by the coefficients `[c0, c1, ..., c(n-1)]` with $c_{n-1} \\n"
"eq 0$."
msgstr ""
"`DensePolynomial[A]` 用系数 `[c0, c1, ..., c(n-1)]` 表示 $c_0 + c_1 x + \\dots + c_{n-1} x^{n-1}$，其中 $c_{n-1} \\n"
"eq 0$。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:30
msgid "Each operation asks only for the coefficient capabilities it uses: addition needs `Eq + AddMonoid`, negation `Eq + Zero + Neg`, multiplication `Eq + AddMonoid + Mul`, and so on. `Eq` and `Zero` are needed whenever a result has to be trimmed."
msgstr "每个操作只要求它实际用到的系数能力：加法需要 `Eq + AddMonoid`，取负需要 `Eq + Zero + Neg`，乘法需要 `Eq + AddMonoid + Mul`，依此类推。凡是结果需要去除末尾零的地方，都需要 `Eq` 和 `Zero`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:36
msgid "Builds the polynomial with the given ascending coefficients, dropping trailing zeros. The array is copied."
msgstr "用给定的升幂系数构造多项式，并去掉末尾的零。数组会被复制。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:44
msgid "Builds the constant polynomial $c$; `constant(0)` is the zero polynomial."
msgstr "构造常数多项式 $c$；`constant(0)` 是零多项式。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:52
msgid "Builds the polynomial $x$."
msgstr "构造多项式 $x$。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:60
msgid "Builds $c\\,x^k$ from `power` $k$ and `coefficient` $c$. A zero coefficient gives the zero polynomial; a negative power aborts."
msgstr "由 `power` $k$ 和 `coefficient` $c$ 构造 $c\\,x^k$。系数为零时得到零多项式；幂为负时中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:68
msgid "Like `monomial`, but returns `None` for a negative power."
msgstr "与 `monomial` 相同，但幂为负时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:76
msgid "The additive and multiplicative identities, also available through `Zero::zero()` and `One::one()`. If the coefficient type has $1 = 0$, `one()` is the zero polynomial."
msgstr "加法单位元和乘法单位元，也可通过 `Zero::zero()` 和 `One::one()` 获得。若系数类型满足 $1 = 0$，则 `one()` 是零多项式。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:96
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:85
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:74
#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:73
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:68
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:64
msgid "Queries"
msgstr "查询"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:100
msgid "Returns a fresh array of the canonical coefficients, lowest degree first; `[]` for zero."
msgstr "返回一个新数组，包含规范系数，低次在前；零多项式返回 `[]`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:108
msgid "Returns the number of stored coefficients, which is the degree plus one, or `0` for zero."
msgstr "返回存储的系数个数，即次数加一；零多项式返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:116
msgid "Returns `Some(length() - 1)`, or `None` for the zero polynomial."
msgstr "返回 `Some(length() - 1)`；对零多项式返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:124
msgid "Returns `true` for the zero polynomial."
msgstr "对零多项式返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:132
msgid "Returns the coefficient of $x^k$; powers beyond the degree read as zero. A negative power aborts."
msgstr "返回 $x^k$ 的系数；超出次数的幂读作零。幂为负时中止。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:140
msgid "Returns `None` for a negative power and `Some(coefficient(k))` otherwise."
msgstr "幂为负时返回 `None`，否则返回 `Some(coefficient(k))`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:148
msgid "`leading_term` returns `(degree, coefficient)` of the highest non-zero term, `leading_coefficient` just the coefficient; both are `None` for zero."
msgstr "`leading_term` 返回最高非零项的 `(degree, coefficient)`，`leading_coefficient` 只返回其系数；对零多项式两者都返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:157
msgid "Returns `PolynomialShape::Univariate(length~)`."
msgstr "返回 `PolynomialShape::Univariate(length~)`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:182
msgid "Coefficient-wise addition, subtraction and negation, the operators `+`, `-` and unary `-`. The result is trimmed, so cancelling leading terms lowers the degree. Cost $O(\\max(m, n))$ for operands of lengths $m$ and $n$."
msgstr "逐系数的加法、减法和取负，即运算符 `+`、`-` 和一元 `-`。结果会去除末尾零，因此首项相消时次数会降低。对长度为 $m$ 和 $n$ 的操作数，代价为 $O(\\max(m, n))$。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:192
msgid "Multiplies by the schoolbook convolution $(fg)_k = \\sum_{i+j=k} f_i g_j$, the operator `*`. Cost $O(mn)$ coefficient multiplications."
msgstr "按教科书式卷积 $(fg)_k = \\sum_{i+j=k} f_i g_j$ 相乘，即运算符 `*`。代价为 $O(mn)$ 次系数乘法。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:200
msgid "Multiplies with Karatsuba's divide-and-conquer algorithm. The result equals `self * other`. When the shorter operand has at most 32 coefficients it falls back to `*`; above that the cost is $O(n^{\\log_2 3}) \\approx O(n^{1.585})$ for operands of length $n$. It needs `Neg` because the middle product is formed by subtraction."
msgstr "使用 Karatsuba 分治算法相乘，结果等于 `self * other`。当较短的操作数至多有 32 个系数时退回到 `*`；超过此规模时，对长度为 $n$ 的操作数代价为 $O(n^{\\log_2 3}) \\approx O(n^{1.585})$。由于中间乘积通过减法得到，它需要 `Neg`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:208
msgid "Returns $c\\,x^k \\cdot p$: shifts the coefficients up by `power` $k$ and multiplies them by `coefficient` $c$. A negative power aborts; a zero coefficient gives zero."
msgstr "返回 $c\\,x^k \\cdot p$：将系数上移 `power` $k$ 位，并乘以 `coefficient` $c$。幂为负时中止；系数为零时得到零。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:216
msgid "Like `scale`, but returns `None` for a negative power."
msgstr "与 `scale` 相同，但幂为负时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:224
msgid "Returns $p^e$ by binary exponentiation, with at most $2\\lfloor \\log_2 e \\rfloor + 1$ multiplications. `pow(0)` is `one()`, also for the zero polynomial."
msgstr "用二进制快速幂计算 $p^e$，至多进行 $2\\lfloor \\log_2 e \\rfloor + 1$ 次乘法。`pow(0)` 是 `one()`，对零多项式也是如此。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:230
msgid "The same function is available as `@arithmetic.PowNatChecked::pow_nat_checked(p, e, context)`, which always returns `Ok` and ignores the context."
msgstr "同一函数也可通过 `@arithmetic.PowNatChecked::pow_nat_checked(p, e, context)` 调用，它总是返回 `Ok` 并忽略上下文。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:247
msgid "Evaluation and calculus"
msgstr "求值与微积分"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:251
msgid "Evaluates $p(a)$ with Horner's rule, $(\\cdots((c_{n-1} a + c_{n-2}) a + c_{n-3}) \\cdots) a + c_0$: $n$ multiplications and $n$ additions for $n$ coefficients."
msgstr "用 Horner 法则求 $p(a)$，即 $(\\cdots((c_{n-1} a + c_{n-2}) a + c_{n-3}) \\cdots) a + c_0$：对 $n$ 个系数需要 $n$ 次乘法和 $n$ 次加法。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:259
msgid "Returns the composition $p(q)$, replacing $x$ by the polynomial $q$, with Horner's rule over polynomials."
msgstr "返回复合 $p(q)$，即把 $x$ 替换为多项式 $q$，在多项式上使用 Horner 法则计算。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:267
msgid "Returns the formal derivative $\\sum_{i \\ge 1} i\\,c_i\\,x^{i-1}$. The factor $i$ is mapped into the coefficient type with `@luna-generic.NatHomomorphism::from_nat`, so in characteristic $p$ the derivative of $x^p$ is zero. `luna-generic` implements `NatHomomorphism` for `Float`, `Double` and `BigInt`, so those are the coefficient types with a derivative; `Int` coefficients have none."
msgstr "返回形式导数 $\\sum_{i \\ge 1} i\\,c_i\\,x^{i-1}$。因子 $i$ 通过 `@luna-generic.NatHomomorphism::from_nat` 映射到系数类型中，因此在特征 $p$ 下 $x^p$ 的导数为零。`luna-generic` 为 `Float`、`Double` 和 `BigInt` 实现了 `NatHomomorphism`，所以只有这些系数类型具有导数；`Int` 系数没有。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:284
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:214
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:217
msgid "Comparison and printing"
msgstr "比较与打印"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:288
msgid "Structural equality of canonical coefficient vectors, which is equality of polynomials. It is `==`."
msgstr "规范系数向量的结构相等，也就是多项式相等。即 `==`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:296
msgid "A structural total order for sorted containers: shorter (lower-degree) polynomials first, then coefficient by coefficient from the constant term up. It is not compatible with the ring operations."
msgstr "供有序容器使用的结构性全序：较短（次数较低）的多项式在前，然后从常数项起逐个比较系数。它与环运算不相容。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:304
msgid "Renders the non-zero terms in ascending degree as `c` for the constant term and `cx^k` otherwise, joined by ` + `; zero prints as the coefficient zero."
msgstr "按升幂输出非零项，常数项写作 `c`，其余写作 `cx^k`，用 ` + ` 连接；零输出为系数零。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:323
msgid "Returns the [`UnivariateOps`](../core.md#univariateops) record of this type, wiring `zero`, `one`, `from_coefficients`, `to_coefficients`, `coefficient`, `coefficient_checked`, `eval`, `+`, `*`, `scale`, `scale_checked` and `pow`."
msgstr "返回该类型的 [`UnivariateOps`](../core.md#univariateops) 记录，其中连接了 `zero`、`one`、`from_coefficients`、`to_coefficients`、`coefficient`、`coefficient_checked`、`eval`、`+`、`*`、`scale`、`scale_checked` 和 `pow`。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:339
msgid "These method forms come from trait implementations. They are hidden from the interface file and kept for source compatibility only."
msgstr "这些方法形式来自 trait 实现。它们在接口文件中被隐藏，仅为源码兼容而保留。"

#: manual/api/immut/dense.md:347
#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:263
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:275
#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:225
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:200
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:192
msgid "`@arithmetic.PowNatChecked::pow_nat_checked(p, e, ctx)` or `p.pow(e)`"
msgstr "`@arithmetic.PowNatChecked::pow_nat_checked(p, e, ctx)` 或 `p.pow(e)`"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:1
msgid "immut/sparse API"
msgstr "immut/sparse API"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/sparse` provides `SparsePolynomial[A]`, an immutable multivariate polynomial stored as an ordered map from `ExponentVector` to non-zero coefficients. It describes the same polynomials as [`TermPolynomial`](term.md) but supports lookup of a single coefficient in logarithmic time."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/sparse` 提供 `SparsePolynomial[A]`，即存储为从 `ExponentVector` 到非零系数的有序映射的不可变多变量多项式。它描述的多项式与 [`TermPolynomial`](term.md) 相同，但支持以对数时间查找单个系数。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:5
msgid "The type is re-exported by the [`immut`](../immut.md) facade as `@immut.SparsePolynomial`, which the examples use. Variables are addressed by index. The design is explained in the [immut/sparse design](../../design/immut/sparse.md)."
msgstr "该类型由 [`immut`](../immut.md) 门面包以 `@immut.SparsePolynomial` 重新导出，示例即使用该形式。变量按下标寻址。设计说明见 [immut/sparse 设计](../../design/immut/sparse.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:11
msgid ""
"`SparsePolynomial[A]` maps each exponent vector $\\alpha$ with $c_\\alpha \\n"
"eq 0$ to $c_\\alpha$. Keys are ordered by the [monomial order](../../design/core.md#the-monomial-order), and the map is iterated in *ascending* order."
msgstr ""
"`SparsePolynomial[A]` 把每个满足 $c_\\alpha \\n"
"eq 0$ 的指数向量 $\\alpha$ 映射到 $c_\\alpha$。键按[单项式序](../../design/core.md#the-monomial-order)排序，映射按*升序*迭代。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:36
msgid "Both return the empty map, the zero polynomial; `zero` is also `Zero::zero()`."
msgstr "两者都返回空映射，即零多项式；`zero` 也是 `Zero::zero()`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:45
msgid "Returns the constant $1$, or the zero polynomial if $1 = 0$ in `A`; also `One::one()`."
msgstr "返回常数 $1$；若在 `A` 中 $1 = 0$，则返回零多项式；也是 `One::one()`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:53
msgid "Builds the polynomial of a list of terms, adding coefficients of equal exponent vectors and dropping zero sums. The input is copied. Cost $O(m \\log m)$ comparisons."
msgstr "由项列表构造多项式，将指数向量相等的项的系数相加，并丢弃和为零的项。输入会被复制。开销为 $O(m \\log m)$ 次比较。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:61
msgid "Like `from_terms`, with each exponent vector given as an `Array[UInt]`."
msgstr "与 `from_terms` 相同，但每个指数向量以 `Array[UInt]` 给出。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:69
msgid "Returns a new polynomial with $c\\,x^\\alpha$ added; a coefficient that becomes zero removes the key. The receiver is unchanged. The whole map is rebuilt, so the cost is $O(m \\log m)$."
msgstr "返回加上 $c\\,x^\\alpha$ 后的新多项式；系数变为零时删除该键。接收者保持不变。整个映射会被重建，因此开销为 $O(m \\log m)$。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:89
msgid "Returns the coefficient of $x^\\alpha$, or `None` when the term is absent (its coefficient is zero). Cost $O(\\log m)$ comparisons."
msgstr "返回 $x^\\alpha$ 的系数；若该项不存在（其系数为零），则返回 `None`。开销为 $O(\\log m)$ 次比较。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:97
msgid "Same as `get`. Every exponent vector is a valid key, so there is no extra failure case; the name exists for symmetry with the other checked APIs."
msgstr "与 `get` 相同。每个指数向量都是合法的键，因此没有额外的失败情形；这个名字只是为了与其他带检查的 API 保持对称。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:105
msgid "Returns the terms as a fresh array in ascending monomial order, the constant term (if any) first. This is the reverse of `TermPolynomial::to_terms`."
msgstr "以单项式序升序返回各项组成的新数组，常数项（如有）在前。这与 `TermPolynomial::to_terms` 的顺序相反。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:113
msgid "Both return the number of stored (non-zero) terms."
msgstr "两者都返回存储的（非零）项数。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:122
msgid "Both return `true` for the zero polynomial."
msgstr "两者对零多项式都返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:131
msgid "The number of variables in use, the largest term degree (`None` for zero), and `PolynomialShape::Multivariate(arity~, term_count~)`."
msgstr "使用中的变量个数、最大的项次数（零多项式为 `None`），以及 `PolynomialShape::Multivariate(arity~, term_count~)`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:154
msgid "The operators `+`, `-` and unary `-`. Addition collects both term lists and rebuilds the map, $O((m+n)\\log(m+n))$; negation is $O(m \\log m)$ map insertions."
msgstr "运算符 `+`、`-` 和一元 `-`。加法收集两个项列表并重建映射，开销为 $O((m+n)\\log(m+n))$；取负为 $O(m \\log m)$ 次映射插入。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:164
msgid "Forms all $mn$ term products and rebuilds the map, the operator `*`. Cost $O(mn \\log(mn))$."
msgstr "构造全部 $mn$ 个项的乘积并重建映射，即运算符 `*`。开销为 $O(mn \\log(mn))$。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:172
msgid "Returns $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$, dropping products that vanish."
msgstr "返回 $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$，丢弃为零的乘积。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:180
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:173
msgid "Returns $p^e$ by binary exponentiation; `pow(0)` is `one()`. Also available through `@arithmetic.PowNatChecked`."
msgstr "通过二进制幂算法返回 $p^e$；`pow(0)` 为 `one()`。也可通过 `@arithmetic.PowNatChecked` 使用。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:199
msgid "Evaluate at `values`, where `values[i]` is the value of variable $i$; at least `arity()` values are required. `eval` aborts on a shorter array, `eval_checked` returns `None`."
msgstr "在 `values` 处求值，其中 `values[i]` 是变量 $i$ 的取值；至少需要 `arity()` 个值。数组过短时，`eval` 中止（abort），`eval_checked` 返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:218
msgid "Compares the term lists, which is polynomial equality. It is `==`."
msgstr "比较项列表，即多项式相等。它就是 `==`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:226
msgid "Renders the terms in ascending order as `c * monomial` (just `c` for the constant term), joined by ` + `; zero prints as the coefficient zero."
msgstr "按升序把各项渲染为 `c * monomial`（常数项只写 `c`），以 ` + ` 连接；零多项式打印为系数零。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:236
#: manual/api/immut/term.md:239
msgid "Returns the [`MultivariateOps`](../core.md#multivariateops) record of this type; `eval_indexed` is `eval`."
msgstr "返回该类型的 [`MultivariateOps`](../core.md#multivariateops) 记录；`eval_indexed` 即 `eval`。"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:250
msgid "Converting to term storage"
msgstr "转换为项存储"

#: manual/api/immut/sparse.md:252
msgid "Go through the term list: `TermPolynomial::from_terms(sparse.to_terms())`. The conversion re-sorts into descending order."
msgstr "经由项列表转换：`TermPolynomial::from_terms(sparse.to_terms())`。转换会重新排序为降序。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:1
msgid "immut/term API"
msgstr "immut/term API"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/term` provides `TermPolynomial[A]`, an immutable multivariate polynomial stored as an array of `(ExponentVector, A)` terms. The array is canonical: sorted in *descending* [monomial order](../../design/core.md#the-monomial-order), with no two terms sharing an exponent vector and no zero coefficients."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/immut/term` 提供 `TermPolynomial[A]`，一种以 `(ExponentVector, A)` 项数组存储的不可变多元多项式。该数组是规范的：按[单项式序](../../design/core.md#the-monomial-order)*降序*排列，没有两个项共享同一指数向量，也没有零系数。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:5
msgid "The type is re-exported by the [`immut`](../immut.md) facade as `@immut.TermPolynomial`, which the examples use. Variables are addressed by index: variable $i$ is position $i$ of the exponent vectors. For named variables use [`ContextPolynomial`](context.md). The design is explained in the [immut/term design](../../design/immut/term.md)."
msgstr "该类型由 [`immut`](../immut.md) 门面包重新导出为 `@immut.TermPolynomial`，示例中使用的就是它。变量按下标寻址：变量 $i$ 是指数向量的第 $i$ 个位置。如需具名变量，请使用 [`ContextPolynomial`](context.md)。设计说明见 [immut/term 设计](../../design/immut/term.md)。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:11
msgid ""
"`TermPolynomial[A]` represents $\\sum_k c_k x^{\\alpha_k}$ by the terms $(\\alpha_k, c_k)$ with $\\alpha_1 \\succ \\alpha_2 \\succ \\cdots$ and every $c_k \\n"
"eq 0$."
msgstr ""
"`TermPolynomial[A]` 用项 $(\\alpha_k, c_k)$ 表示 $\\sum_k c_k x^{\\alpha_k}$，其中 $\\alpha_1 \\succ \\alpha_2 \\succ \\cdots$ 且每个 $c_k \\n"
"eq 0$。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:35
msgid "Builds the canonical polynomial of a list of terms: sorts them, adds the coefficients of equal exponent vectors, and drops zero sums. The input is copied. Cost $O(m \\log m)$ comparisons for $m$ input terms."
msgstr "由一组项构建规范多项式：对它们排序，将指数向量相同的项的系数相加，并丢弃和为零的项。输入会被复制。对 $m$ 个输入项，代价为 $O(m \\log m)$ 次比较。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:43
msgid "Like `from_terms`, with each exponent vector given as an `Array[UInt]` (converted with `ExponentVector::from_array`)."
msgstr "与 `from_terms` 相同，但每个指数向量以 `Array[UInt]` 给出（用 `ExponentVector::from_array` 转换）。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:51
msgid "The empty polynomial and the constant $1$ (the zero polynomial if $1 = 0$ in `A`), also `Zero::zero()` and `One::one()`."
msgstr "空多项式与常数 $1$（若在 `A` 中 $1 = 0$，则为零多项式），也可写作 `Zero::zero()` 和 `One::one()`。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:72
msgid "`[1, 0]` and `[1]` are the same monomial, so $2x_0 - 2x_0$ cancels."
msgstr "`[1, 0]` 和 `[1]` 是同一个单项式，因此 $2x_0 - 2x_0$ 相消。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:78
msgid "Returns a fresh array of the canonical terms, leading term first."
msgstr "返回规范项的新数组，首项在前。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:86
msgid "Returns the coefficients in the order of `to_terms`."
msgstr "按 `to_terms` 的顺序返回系数。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:94
msgid "Both return the number of non-zero terms."
msgstr "两者都返回非零项的个数。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:103
msgid "Returns `true` when there are no terms."
msgstr "没有项时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:111
msgid "Returns the number of variables in use: the longest canonical exponent vector, `0` for constants and zero."
msgstr "返回使用中的变量个数：最长的规范指数向量的长度，常数和零为 `0`。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:119
msgid "Returns the largest total degree of a term, or `None` for zero."
msgstr "返回项的最大全次数；零多项式返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:127
msgid "Returns `PolynomialShape::Multivariate(arity~, term_count~)`."
msgstr "返回 `PolynomialShape::Multivariate(arity~, term_count~)`。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:147
msgid "Addition, subtraction and negation, the operators `+`, `-` and unary `-`. Addition concatenates the terms and renormalizes, $O((m + n) \\log(m + n))$; negation keeps the order, $O(m)$."
msgstr "加法、减法与取负，即运算符 `+`、`-` 和一元 `-`。加法拼接项并重新规范化，$O((m + n) \\log(m + n))$；取负保持顺序，$O(m)$。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:157
msgid "Multiplies every term of one operand by every term of the other and renormalizes, the operator `*`. Cost $O(mn \\log(mn))$ for $m$ and $n$ terms."
msgstr "将一个操作数的每一项与另一个操作数的每一项相乘并重新规范化，即运算符 `*`。对 $m$ 项和 $n$ 项，代价为 $O(mn \\log(mn))$。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:165
msgid "Returns $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$ for an exponent vector $\\gamma$ and a coefficient $c$. Products that vanish are dropped. The result stays sorted without re-sorting, so the cost is $O(m)$ term operations."
msgstr "对指数向量 $\\gamma$ 和系数 $c$ 返回 $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$。乘积为零的项被丢弃。结果无需重新排序即保持有序，因此代价为 $O(m)$ 次项运算。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:194
msgid "Evaluates at the point `values`, where `values[i]` is the value of variable $i$. Each term is evaluated as $c \\prod_i a_i^{\\alpha_i}$ with binary exponentiation. It aborts when `values` is shorter than `arity()`; extra values are ignored."
msgstr "在点 `values` 处求值，其中 `values[i]` 是变量 $i$ 的值。每一项按 $c \\prod_i a_i^{\\alpha_i}$ 用二分幂求值。当 `values` 短于 `arity()` 时中止（abort）；多余的值被忽略。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:202
msgid "Like `eval`, but returns `None` when `values.length() < arity()`."
msgstr "与 `eval` 相同，但当 `values.length() < arity()` 时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:221
msgid "Structural equality of the canonical term arrays, which is equality of polynomials. It is `==`. There is no `Compare` instance."
msgstr "规范项数组的结构相等，即多项式相等。它就是 `==`。没有 `Compare` 实例。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:229
msgid "Renders the terms in stored order as `c * monomial` (just `c` for the constant term), joined by ` + `; zero prints as the coefficient zero. Monomials use the `ExponentVector` notation."
msgstr "按存储顺序以 `c * monomial` 的形式渲染各项（常数项仅为 `c`），以 ` + ` 连接；零打印为系数零。单项式使用 `ExponentVector` 的记法。"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:253
msgid "Converting to sparse storage"
msgstr "转换为稀疏存储"

#: manual/api/immut/term.md:255
msgid "There is no direct conversion method; go through the term list, which re-applies canonicalization:"
msgstr "没有直接的转换方法；需经由项列表，这会重新进行规范化："

#: manual/api/internal.md:1
msgid "internal API"
msgstr "internal API"

#: manual/api/internal.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/internal` holds helpers shared by the implementation packages. MoonBit restricts an `internal` package to importers inside the same module, so this page documents the contract the representations rely on; code outside `luna-poly` cannot call it."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/internal` 存放各实现包共用的辅助函数。MoonBit 规定 `internal` 包只能被同一模块内的包导入，因此本页记录的是各表示所依赖的契约；`luna-poly` 之外的代码无法调用它。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:5
msgid "Powers"
msgstr "幂"

#: manual/api/internal.md:9
msgid "Computes $a^e$ for a natural exponent by binary exponentiation, starting from the unit `one`."
msgstr "从单位元 `one` 出发，用二进制快速幂计算自然数指数的 $a^e$。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:15
msgid "`pow_nat(a, 0, one=u)` returns `u`, whatever `a` is; this is how every `pow(0)` in the library returns one, including for zero."
msgstr "无论 `a` 是什么，`pow_nat(a, 0, one=u)` 都返回 `u`；库中每个 `pow(0)` 都由此返回一，包括对零也是如此。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:16
msgid "It performs $\\lfloor \\log_2 e \\rfloor$ squarings and at most one further multiplication per set bit of $e$, so at most $2\\lfloor \\log_2 e \\rfloor + 1$ calls of `*`."
msgstr "它执行 $\\lfloor \\log_2 e \\rfloor$ 次平方，并且对 $e$ 的每个置位至多再做一次乘法，因此至多调用 $2\\lfloor \\log_2 e \\rfloor + 1$ 次 `*`。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:17
msgid "It needs only an associative `*` for which `one` is a left unit; it does not need commutativity, because every factor it multiplies is a power of `a`."
msgstr "它只需要一个满足结合律、且以 `one` 为左单位元的 `*`；不需要交换律，因为它相乘的每个因子都是 `a` 的幂。"

#: manual/api/internal.md:19
msgid "It is used for polynomial powers (`DensePolynomial::pow`, `TermPolynomial::pow`, `SparsePolynomial::pow`) and for coefficient powers $a_i^{\\alpha_i}$ during evaluation and substitution."
msgstr "它用于多项式的幂（`DensePolynomial::pow`、`TermPolynomial::pow`、`SparsePolynomial::pow`），以及求值和代换过程中系数的幂 $a_i^{\\alpha_i}$。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:1
msgid "mutable API"
msgstr "mutable API"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable` is the facade of the mutable polynomial layer. It defines nothing of its own: it re-exports the shared [`core`](core.md) vocabulary, the common algebra traits of `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`, and the four mutable representations, so one import gives access to the whole execution-oriented API. It exports the same names as the [`immut`](immut.md) facade."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable` 是可变多项式层的门面包。它自身不定义任何内容：它重新导出共享的 [`core`](core.md) 词汇、`Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 的通用代数 trait 以及四种可变表示，因此一次导入即可访问整个面向执行的 API。它导出的名字与 [`immut`](immut.md) 门面包相同。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:11
msgid "Every name below is a `pub using` alias: `@mutable.DensePolynomial` *is* `@mutable/dense.DensePolynomial`, and `@mutable.ExponentVector` *is* `@core.ExponentVector`, the same type as `@immut.ExponentVector`. Methods are documented on the page of the package that defines the type."
msgstr "下列每个名字都是 `pub using` 别名：`@mutable.DensePolynomial` *就是* `@mutable/dense.DensePolynomial`，`@mutable.ExponentVector` *就是* `@core.ExponentVector`，与 `@immut.ExponentVector` 是同一类型。方法在定义该类型的包的页面中说明。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:17
msgid "Mutable dense univariate polynomial. See the [mutable/dense API](mutable/dense.md)."
msgstr "可变稠密一元多项式。参见 [mutable/dense API](mutable/dense.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:25
msgid "Mutable multivariate polynomial as a sorted term array. See the [mutable/term API](mutable/term.md)."
msgstr "以有序项数组表示的可变多元多项式。参见 [mutable/term API](mutable/term.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:33
msgid "Mutable multivariate polynomial as an ordered map. See the [mutable/sparse API](mutable/sparse.md)."
msgstr "以有序映射表示的可变多元多项式。参见 [mutable/sparse API](mutable/sparse.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:41
msgid "Mutable polynomial over a named-variable context, and the payload of its substitutions. See the [mutable/context API](mutable/context.md)."
msgstr "具名变量上下文上的可变多项式，以及其代换的载荷。参见 [mutable/context API](mutable/context.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:48
msgid "The alias re-exports the type, not its constructors as standalone values: write `Scalar(v)` and `Polynomial(p)` where the expected type is known, or `@mutable.ContextSubstitutionValue::Polynomial(p)` in full."
msgstr "别名重新导出的是类型，而不是作为独立值的构造器：在期望类型已知时写 `Scalar(v)` 和 `Polynomial(p)`，否则写全称 `@mutable.ContextSubstitutionValue::Polynomial(p)`。"

#: manual/api/mutable.md:94
msgid "Every mutable container implements `Clearable`, `Copyable` and `MutablePolynomial`, in addition to the observation bundle of its family."
msgstr "每个可变容器除了实现其所属族的观察组合外，还实现 `Clearable`、`Copyable` 和 `MutablePolynomial`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:1
msgid "mutable/context API"
msgstr "mutable/context API"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/context` provides a mutable `ContextPolynomial[A]`: a cell holding an [`immut/context`](../immut/context.md) polynomial that `add_inplace`, `mul_inplace` and `clear` replace. Every other operation delegates to the immutable implementation and has its semantics, failure cases and costs."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/context` 提供可变的 `ContextPolynomial[A]`：一个持有 [`immut/context`](../immut/context.md) 多项式的单元，`add_inplace`、`mul_inplace` 和 `clear` 会替换其中的值。其他所有操作都委托给不可变实现，并具有相同的语义、失败情形和开销。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:5
msgid "The types are re-exported by the [`mutable`](../mutable.md) facade, which the examples use. \"As in immut\" refers to the [immut/context API](../immut/context.md). The design is in [mutable/context design](../../design/mutable/context.md)."
msgstr "这些类型由 [`mutable`](../mutable.md) 门面包重新导出，示例即使用该门面包。“与 immut 相同”指 [immut/context API](../immut/context.md)。设计说明见 [mutable/context 设计](../../design/mutable/context.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:11
msgid "A mutable polynomial over a `VariableContext`."
msgstr "基于 `VariableContext` 的可变多项式。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:33
msgid "The replacement for one variable: a scalar or a mutable context polynomial over the same context. It is a separate type from the immutable `ContextSubstitutionValue`; it is converted when the substitution is delegated."
msgstr "某一变量的替换值：标量，或同一上下文上的可变上下文多项式。它是与不可变的 `ContextSubstitutionValue` 不同的独立类型；在委托代换时会进行转换。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:42
#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:33
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:37
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:34
msgid "Construction and conversion"
msgstr "构造与转换"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:46
msgid "Wrap an immutable context polynomial, and return the immutable value currently held. Neither copies; this is safe because the held value is immutable and mutations replace it rather than change it."
msgstr "包装一个不可变上下文多项式，以及返回当前持有的不可变值。两者都不复制；这是安全的，因为所持有的值是不可变的，修改操作是替换它而不是改变它。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:55
msgid "Build from named terms, as in immut."
msgstr "由命名项构造，与 immut 相同。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:66
msgid "Bind a *mutable* term or sparse polynomial to a context. The polynomial is converted to its immutable form, so later mutation of the argument does not affect the result. As in immut, the arity is not checked against the context size."
msgstr "把*可变*的项多项式或稀疏多项式绑定到上下文。多项式会被转换为其不可变形式，因此之后修改参数不会影响结果。与 immut 相同，不会检查元数是否超过上下文大小。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:75
#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:95
#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:120
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:153
msgid "As in immut."
msgstr "与 immut 相同。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:85
msgid "Returns a new cell holding the same immutable value, $O(1)$ (also `Copyable::copy`). Mutating either cell afterwards does not affect the other."
msgstr "返回持有同一不可变值的新单元，开销 $O(1)$（也是 `Copyable::copy`）。此后修改任一单元都不会影响另一个。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:109
msgid "Return a new *mutable* term or sparse polynomial with the current terms."
msgstr "返回包含当前各项的新的*可变*项多项式或稀疏多项式。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:116
msgid "Evaluation and substitution"
msgstr "求值与代换"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:131
msgid "Partial evaluation, returning a new mutable polynomial over the same context, as in immut."
msgstr "部分求值，返回同一上下文上的新可变多项式，与 immut 相同。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:142
msgid "Simultaneous substitution by scalars or mutable polynomials over the same context, returning a new mutable polynomial, as in immut."
msgstr "用标量或同一上下文上的可变多项式进行同时代换，返回新的可变多项式，与 immut 相同。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:151
msgid "Arithmetic and mutation"
msgstr "算术与修改"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:155
msgid "Replace the held value by `self + other` or `self * other`. They abort when the contexts differ; there are no checked variants on the mutable type (use `ops().add_checked` or the immutable `add_checked` through `to_immut`)."
msgstr "把持有的值替换为 `self + other` 或 `self * other`。上下文不同时中止（abort）；可变类型上没有带检查的变体（请使用 `ops().add_checked`，或通过 `to_immut` 使用不可变的 `add_checked`）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:164
msgid "Replaces the held value by the zero polynomial over the same context (also `Clearable::clear`)."
msgstr "把持有的值替换为同一上下文上的零多项式（也是 `Clearable::clear`）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:172
msgid "Operators and powers returning new cells, as in immut; binary operators abort on different contexts."
msgstr "返回新单元的运算符与幂，与 immut 相同；上下文不同时二元运算符会中止（abort）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/context.md:184
msgid "The [`ContextOps`](../core.md#contextops) record; its `add_checked` and `mul_checked` return `None` on different contexts."
msgstr "[`ContextOps`](../core.md#contextops) 记录；其 `add_checked` 和 `mul_checked` 在上下文不同时返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:1
msgid "mutable/dense API"
msgstr "mutable/dense API"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/dense` provides a mutable `DensePolynomial[A]`: the same canonical ascending coefficient storage as [`immut/dense`](../immut/dense.md), held in a growable array that setters and `_inplace` methods update. Operators and all other methods return new values and leave their operands untouched."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/dense` 提供可变的 `DensePolynomial[A]`：采用与 [`immut/dense`](../immut/dense.md) 相同的规范升幂系数存储，保存在一个可增长的数组中，由 setter 和 `_inplace` 方法更新。运算符及其他所有方法都返回新值，不改动其操作数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:5
msgid "The type is re-exported by the [`mutable`](../mutable.md) facade as `@mutable.DensePolynomial`, which the examples use. Methods marked \"as in immut\" have exactly the semantics, bounds and costs described on the [immut/dense API](../immut/dense.md) page. The mutation model is explained in the [mutable/dense design](../../design/mutable/dense.md)."
msgstr "该类型由 [`mutable`](../mutable.md) 门面包重新导出为 `@mutable.DensePolynomial`，示例中使用的就是它。标注“同 immut”的方法，其语义、约束和代价与 [immut/dense API](../immut/dense.md) 页面所述完全相同。可变模型见 [mutable/dense 设计](../../design/mutable/dense.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:11
msgid "A mutable dense univariate polynomial whose stored array never ends in a zero coefficient."
msgstr "可变的稠密一元多项式，其存储数组从不以零系数结尾。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:37
msgid "Build polynomials, as in immut. `from_coefficients` copies its input."
msgstr "构造多项式，同 immut。`from_coefficients` 会复制其输入。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:51
msgid "Returns a new mutable polynomial with the coefficients of an immutable one."
msgstr "返回一个新的可变多项式，其系数取自一个不可变多项式。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:59
msgid "Returns an immutable snapshot of the current coefficients. Later mutation of the receiver does not affect the snapshot."
msgstr "返回当前系数的不可变快照。之后对接收者的修改不会影响该快照。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:67
msgid "Returns an independent copy (also `Copyable::copy`). $O(n)$."
msgstr "返回一个独立副本（也即 `Copyable::copy`）。$O(n)$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:77
msgid "As in immut. `to_coefficients` returns a copy, so mutating the result does not affect the polynomial."
msgstr "同 immut。`to_coefficients` 返回副本，因此修改结果不会影响多项式。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:91
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:87
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:81
msgid "Mutation"
msgstr "修改"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:95
msgid "Sets the coefficient of $x^k$, growing the array when $k$ is beyond the degree and trimming afterwards, so setting the leading coefficient to zero lowers the degree. A negative power aborts; there is no checked variant."
msgstr "设置 $x^k$ 的系数：当 $k$ 超出次数时扩展数组，之后去除末尾零，因此把首项系数设为零会降低次数。幂为负时中止；没有带检查的变体。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:103
msgid "Makes the receiver the zero polynomial (also `Clearable::clear`)."
msgstr "使接收者成为零多项式（也即 `Clearable::clear`）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:111
msgid "Replaces the receiver by `self + other`, adding into the existing array; $O(\\max(m, n))$. `p.add_inplace(p)` doubles `p`."
msgstr "将接收者替换为 `self + other`，直接加到现有数组上；$O(\\max(m, n))$。`p.add_inplace(p)` 使 `p` 加倍。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:119
msgid "Replaces the receiver by `self * other` (schoolbook, $O(mn)$). The product is computed into a new array first, so `p.mul_inplace(p)` squares `p`."
msgstr "将接收者替换为 `self * other`（教科书算法，$O(mn)$）。乘积先计算到新数组中，因此 `p.mul_inplace(p)` 得到 `p` 的平方。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:127
msgid "Replaces the receiver by $c\\,x^k \\cdot p$. A negative power aborts."
msgstr "将接收者替换为 $c\\,x^k \\cdot p$。幂为负时中止。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:151
#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:154
#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:138
msgid "Non-mutating operations"
msgstr "非修改操作"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:155
msgid "The operators `+`, `-`, `*` and unary `-`, returning new polynomials, as in immut."
msgstr "运算符 `+`、`-`、`*` 和一元 `-`，返回新多项式，同 immut。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:166
msgid "As in immut; computed by converting to the immutable type and back."
msgstr "同 immut；通过转换为不可变类型再转换回来计算。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:177
msgid "Horner evaluation, composition $p(q)$ and the formal derivative, as in immut."
msgstr "Horner 求值、复合 $p(q)$ 和形式导数，同 immut。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:187
msgid "Structural equality, the structural order (degree first, then coefficients from the constant term) and printing, as in immut."
msgstr "结构相等、结构序（先比较次数，再从常数项起比较系数）以及打印，同 immut。"

#: manual/api/mutable/dense.md:197
msgid "The [`UnivariateOps`](../core.md#univariateops) record of the mutable type. Its functions do not mutate their arguments."
msgstr "可变类型的 [`UnivariateOps`](../core.md#univariateops) 记录。其中的函数不会修改参数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:1
msgid "mutable/sparse API"
msgstr "mutable/sparse API"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/sparse` provides a mutable `SparsePolynomial[A]`: an ordered map from `ExponentVector` to non-zero coefficients, like [`immut/sparse`](../immut/sparse.md), with methods that update the map in place in logarithmic time."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/sparse` 提供可变的 `SparsePolynomial[A]`：与 [`immut/sparse`](../immut/sparse.md) 一样，是从 `ExponentVector` 到非零系数的有序映射，其方法以对数时间原地更新该映射。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:5
msgid "The type is re-exported by the [`mutable`](../mutable.md) facade as `@mutable.SparsePolynomial`, which the examples use. \"As in immut\" means the semantics, bounds and costs of the [immut/sparse API](../immut/sparse.md). The mutation model is explained in the [mutable/sparse design](../../design/mutable/sparse.md)."
msgstr "该类型由 [`mutable`](../mutable.md) 门面包重新导出为 `@mutable.SparsePolynomial`，示例中使用的就是它。“同 immut”指与 [immut/sparse API](../immut/sparse.md) 的语义、约束和代价相同。可变模型见 [mutable/sparse 设计](../../design/mutable/sparse.md)。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:11
msgid "A mutable map from exponent vectors to non-zero coefficients, iterated in ascending monomial order."
msgstr "从指数向量到非零系数的可变映射，按单项式序升序迭代。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:35
msgid "`Copyable` and `MutablePolynomial` need `Eq + AddMonoid` coefficients here, because `copy` rebuilds the map through `from_terms`."
msgstr "这里 `Copyable` 和 `MutablePolynomial` 要求系数满足 `Eq + AddMonoid`，因为 `copy` 通过 `from_terms` 重建映射。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:41
msgid "Build polynomials, as in immut."
msgstr "构造多项式，同 immut。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:53
msgid "Convert from and to the immutable type; both build a new map."
msgstr "与不可变类型互相转换；两者都会构建新的映射。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:62
msgid "Returns an independent copy (also `Copyable::copy`), $O(m \\log m)$."
msgstr "返回一个独立副本（也即 `Copyable::copy`），$O(m \\log m)$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:72
msgid "As in immut: `get` is an $O(\\log m)$ lookup returning `None` for absent (zero) terms, and `to_terms` returns a fresh array in ascending order."
msgstr "同 immut：`get` 是 $O(\\log m)$ 的查找，对不存在的（零）项返回 `None`；`to_terms` 返回按升序排列的新数组。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:91
msgid "Sets the coefficient of $x^\\alpha$; setting it to zero removes the key. $O(\\log m)$."
msgstr "设置 $x^\\alpha$ 的系数；设为零会删除该键。$O(\\log m)$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:99
msgid "Adds $c\\,x^\\alpha$: inserts a new key, or adds to the existing coefficient and removes the key when the sum is zero. A zero $c$ does nothing. $O(\\log m)$."
msgstr "加上 $c\\,x^\\alpha$：插入新键，或加到已有系数上，并在和为零时删除该键。$c$ 为零时不做任何事。$O(\\log m)$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:107
msgid "Adds every term of `other` with `add_term_inplace`, $O(n \\log(m + n))$. `p.add_inplace(p)` doubles `p`."
msgstr "用 `add_term_inplace` 逐项加上 `other` 的每一项，$O(n \\log(m + n))$。`p.add_inplace(p)` 使 `p` 加倍。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:115
msgid "Replaces the contents by `self * other`; the product is computed first, so `p.mul_inplace(p)` squares `p`."
msgstr "将内容替换为 `self * other`；乘积先算出，因此 `p.mul_inplace(p)` 得到 `p` 的平方。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:123
msgid "Replaces the contents by $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$."
msgstr "将内容替换为 $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:131
msgid "Removes every term (also `Clearable::clear`)."
msgstr "删除所有项（也即 `Clearable::clear`）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:158
msgid "The operators and arithmetic methods, returning new polynomials, as in immut. `+` copies the receiver and calls `add_inplace`."
msgstr "运算符和算术方法，返回新多项式，同 immut。`+` 复制接收者并调用 `add_inplace`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/sparse.md:171
msgid "Evaluation, equality, printing and the [`MultivariateOps`](../core.md#multivariateops) record, as in immut."
msgstr "求值、相等、打印以及 [`MultivariateOps`](../core.md#multivariateops) 记录，同 immut。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:1
msgid "mutable/term API"
msgstr "mutable/term API"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:3
msgid "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/term` provides a mutable `TermPolynomial[A]`: the canonical descending term array of [`immut/term`](../immut/term.md), held in a mutable field that `_inplace` methods and `clear` replace. Operators and all other methods return new values."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/luna-poly/mutable/term` 提供可变的 `TermPolynomial[A]`：即 [`immut/term`](../immut/term.md) 的规范降序项数组，保存在一个可变字段中，由 `_inplace` 方法和 `clear` 替换。运算符和其他所有方法都返回新值。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:5
msgid "The type is re-exported by the [`mutable`](../mutable.md) facade as `@mutable.TermPolynomial`, which the examples use. \"As in immut\" means the semantics, bounds and costs of the [immut/term API](../immut/term.md). The mutation model is explained in the [mutable/term design](../../design/mutable/term.md)."
msgstr "该类型由 [`mutable`](../mutable.md) 门面包重新导出为 `@mutable.TermPolynomial`，示例中使用的就是它。“同 immut”指的是 [immut/term API](../immut/term.md) 中的语义、约束和代价。变更模型在 [mutable/term 设计](../../design/mutable/term.md)中说明。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:11
msgid "A mutable multivariate polynomial whose term array is always sorted in descending monomial order, merged, and free of zero coefficients."
msgstr "可变多元多项式，其项数组始终按单项式序降序排列、已合并且不含零系数。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:38
msgid "Build polynomials, as in immut. The input array is copied."
msgstr "构建多项式，同 immut。输入数组会被复制。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:49
msgid "Convert from and to the immutable type. Both copy, so later mutation never affects the other value. `to_immut` re-normalizes the terms, $O(m \\log m)$."
msgstr "与不可变类型相互转换。两者都会复制，因此之后的变更绝不会影响另一个值。`to_immut` 会重新规范化各项，$O(m \\log m)$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:58
msgid "Returns an independent copy (also `Copyable::copy`)."
msgstr "返回一个独立副本（也可用 `Copyable::copy`）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:68
msgid "As in immut. `to_terms` and `coefficients` return fresh arrays, leading term first."
msgstr "同 immut。`to_terms` 和 `coefficients` 返回新数组，首项在前。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:85
msgid "Adds $c\\,x^\\alpha$ to the receiver: merges with an existing term of the same exponent vector and removes it if the sum is zero. The whole array is renormalized, $O(m \\log m)$."
msgstr "将 $c\\,x^\\alpha$ 加到接收者上：与指数向量相同的已有项合并，若和为零则将其移除。整个数组会重新规范化，$O(m \\log m)$。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:93
msgid "Replaces the receiver by `self + other` by adding the terms of `other` one at a time with `add_term_inplace`. For $n$ terms in `other` this costs $O(n\\,(m + n)\\log(m + n))$; for large operands prefer `p = p + q` or `from_terms` on the concatenated terms."
msgstr "用 `add_term_inplace` 将 `other` 的项逐个加入，从而把接收者替换为 `self + other`。若 `other` 有 $n$ 项，代价为 $O(n\\,(m + n)\\log(m + n))$；对于大的操作数，宜使用 `p = p + q`，或对拼接后的项使用 `from_terms`。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:101
msgid "Replaces the receiver by `self * other`; the product is computed first, so `p.mul_inplace(p)` squares `p`."
msgstr "将接收者替换为 `self * other`；乘积先被计算出来，因此 `p.mul_inplace(p)` 会将 `p` 平方。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:109
msgid "Replaces the receiver by $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$, keeping the order without re-sorting."
msgstr "将接收者替换为 $c\\,x^\\gamma \\cdot p$，无需重新排序即保持顺序。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:117
msgid "Makes the receiver zero (also `Clearable::clear`)."
msgstr "将接收者置为零（也可用 `Clearable::clear`）。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:142
msgid "The operators `+`, `-`, `*` and unary `-`, as in immut. `+` copies the receiver and calls `add_inplace`, so it has that method's cost; `*` delegates to the immutable product."
msgstr "运算符 `+`、`-`、`*` 和一元 `-`，同 immut。`+` 复制接收者并调用 `add_inplace`，因此其代价与该方法相同；`*` 委托给不可变乘积。"

#: manual/api/mutable/term.md:164
msgid "Structural equality, printing and the [`MultivariateOps`](../core.md#multivariateops) record, as in immut."
msgstr "结构相等、打印以及 [`MultivariateOps`](../core.md#multivariateops) 记录，同 immut。"

#: manual/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: manual/architecture.md:3
msgid "This guide describes how the packages of `luna-poly` fit together: the layers, the dependency graph, where each invariant is enforced, and how the immutable and mutable layers share their algorithms."
msgstr "本指南介绍 `luna-poly` 各包如何组合在一起：分层、依赖图、各不变量在何处得到保证，以及不可变层与可变层如何共享算法。"

#: manual/architecture.md:5
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "分层"

#: manual/architecture.md:7
msgid "`luna-poly` has three layers:"
msgstr "`luna-poly` 分为三层："

#: manual/architecture.md:9
msgid "**Vocabulary**: [`core`](design/core.md) defines monomials (`ExponentVector`), named variables (`Variable`, `VariableContext`), shapes, capability traits and operation records. It stores no polynomials."
msgstr "**词汇层**：[`core`](design/core.md) 定义单项式（`ExponentVector`）、命名变量（`Variable`、`VariableContext`）、形状、能力 trait 和操作记录。它不存储任何多项式。"

#: manual/architecture.md:10
msgid "**Representations**: four immutable packages (`immut/dense`, `immut/term`, `immut/sparse`, `immut/context`) and their four mutable counterparts implement polynomial storage and algorithms."
msgstr "**表示层**：四个不可变包（`immut/dense`、`immut/term`、`immut/sparse`、`immut/context`）及其四个可变对应包实现多项式的存储与算法。"

#: manual/architecture.md:11
msgid "**Facades**: `immut` and `mutable` re-export the vocabulary, the `luna-generic` algebra traits and the representations of their layer."
msgstr "**门面层**：`immut` 和 `mutable` 重新导出词汇层、`luna-generic` 代数 trait 以及各自所在层的表示。"

#: manual/architecture.md:13
msgid "`internal` holds module-private helpers, and `consistency` holds tests only."
msgstr "`internal` 存放模块私有的辅助函数，`consistency` 只包含测试。"

#: manual/architecture.md:15
msgid "Dependency graph"
msgstr "依赖图"

#: manual/architecture.md:38
msgid "In words: every representation depends on `core`; the immutable representations and the mutable term and sparse packages use `internal` for powers; `immut/context` is built on `immut/term` and `immut/sparse`; each mutable package depends on its immutable counterpart; `mutable/context` additionally uses the mutable term and sparse packages for its conversions; each facade depends on the packages of its layer; `consistency` depends on both facades in tests only. `arithmetic` is needed for `PowNatChecked`, and `type_theory/core` for `Name`."
msgstr "用文字描述：每个表示都依赖 `core`；不可变表示以及可变的 term 与 sparse 包使用 `internal` 计算幂；`immut/context` 建立在 `immut/term` 和 `immut/sparse` 之上；每个可变包依赖其不可变对应包；`mutable/context` 还使用可变的 term 与 sparse 包进行转换；每个门面包依赖其所在层的各包；`consistency` 仅在测试中依赖两个门面包。`PowNatChecked` 需要 `arithmetic`，`Name` 需要 `type_theory/core`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:40
msgid "Where invariants live"
msgstr "不变量所在位置"

#: manual/architecture.md:42
msgid "Invariant"
msgstr "不变量"

#: manual/architecture.md:42
msgid "Enforced in"
msgstr "保证位置"

#: manual/architecture.md:44
msgid "exponent vectors have no trailing zeros; degree cached"
msgstr "指数向量没有末尾的零；次数被缓存"

#: manual/architecture.md:45
msgid "monomial order is a graded monomial order"
msgstr "单项式序是分次单项式序"

#: manual/architecture.md:46
msgid "context names are distinct; index = position"
msgstr "上下文中的名字互不相同；下标 = 位置"

#: manual/architecture.md:47
msgid "dense coefficients have no trailing zeros"
msgstr "稠密系数没有末尾的零"

#: manual/architecture.md:47
msgid "`immut/dense`, `mutable/dense` (every constructor and mutation)"
msgstr "`immut/dense`、`mutable/dense`（每个构造器和修改操作）"

#: manual/architecture.md:48
msgid "term arrays are strictly descending, merged, zero-free"
msgstr "项数组严格降序、已合并、不含零"

#: manual/architecture.md:48
msgid "`immut/term` (`from_terms` normalization), reused by `mutable/term`"
msgstr "`immut/term`（`from_terms` 规范化），由 `mutable/term` 复用"

#: manual/architecture.md:49
msgid "sparse maps hold no zero values"
msgstr "稀疏映射不含零值"

#: manual/architecture.md:49
msgid "`immut/sparse`, `mutable/sparse` (every insertion)"
msgstr "`immut/sparse`、`mutable/sparse`（每次插入）"

#: manual/architecture.md:50
msgid "context operations validate variables, duplicates and contexts"
msgstr "上下文操作校验变量、重复项和上下文"

#: manual/architecture.md:50
msgid "`immut/context`, reused by `mutable/context`"
msgstr "`immut/context`，由 `mutable/context` 复用"

#: manual/architecture.md:52
msgid "How the layers share code"
msgstr "各层如何共享代码"

#: manual/architecture.md:54
msgid "The mutable layer implements in-place updates directly on its storage and delegates every non-trivial algorithm to the immutable layer through `to_immut` / `from_immut`. `mutable/context` is a mutable cell around an immutable context polynomial. This keeps one implementation of Karatsuba, composition, derivatives, multivariate products and all context logic, and the `consistency` tests check the agreement."
msgstr "可变层直接在其存储上实现原地更新，并通过 `to_immut` / `from_immut` 把所有非平凡算法委托给不可变层。`mutable/context` 是包裹不可变上下文多项式的可变单元。这样 Karatsuba、复合、求导、多变量乘积以及全部上下文逻辑都只有一份实现，并由 `consistency` 测试检查两层的一致性。"

#: manual/architecture.md:56
msgid "Data flow of a substitution"
msgstr "一次代换的数据流"

#: manual/architecture.md:58
msgid "`ContextPolynomial::substitute_names` shows all layers at once:"
msgstr "`ContextPolynomial::substitute_names` 一次性展示了所有层："

#: manual/architecture.md:60
msgid "each `type_theory` `Name` is resolved to a `Variable` with `VariableContext::variable_by_type_theory_name` (`core`);"
msgstr "每个 `type_theory` 的 `Name` 通过 `VariableContext::variable_by_type_theory_name`（`core`）解析为 `Variable`；"

#: manual/architecture.md:61
msgid "the substitution list is validated (membership, duplicates, equal contexts) in `immut/context`;"
msgstr "代换列表在 `immut/context` 中进行校验（成员关系、重复项、上下文相等）；"

#: manual/architecture.md:62
msgid "every term is rewritten as a product of powers of the replacements, using the term or sparse arithmetic and `internal.pow_nat`;"
msgstr "每一项都被改写为各替换值的幂的乘积，使用 term 或 sparse 算术以及 `internal.pow_nat`；"

#: manual/architecture.md:63
msgid "the partial results are added and canonicalized by the sparse representation."
msgstr "部分结果由稀疏表示相加并规范化。"

#: manual/architecture.md:65
msgid "The mutable version converts its payload to the immutable one, runs the same steps, and wraps the result."
msgstr "可变版本把其载荷转换为不可变的载荷，执行相同的步骤，再把结果包装起来。"

#: manual/architecture.md:67
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/architecture.md:69
msgid "Inline `test` blocks next to each implementation check representation-specific behaviour, including the `type_theory` name lookups in `core` and the named substitution tests in both context packages."
msgstr "每个实现旁边的内联 `test` 块检查与表示相关的行为，包括 `core` 中的 `type_theory` 名字查找，以及两个上下文包中的命名代换测试。"

#: manual/architecture.md:70
msgid "`src/immut/laws_wbtest.mbt` checks algebraic laws with `moonbitlang/quickcheck`."
msgstr "`src/immut/laws_wbtest.mbt` 用 `moonbitlang/quickcheck` 检查代数定律。"

#: manual/architecture.md:71
msgid "`src/consistency/core_wbtest.mbt` checks agreement across layers and representations."
msgstr "`src/consistency/core_wbtest.mbt` 检查各层与各表示之间的一致性。"

#: manual/architecture.md:73
msgid "Run everything with `moon test`; see the [contributing guide](contributing.md) for the full pre-PR sequence."
msgstr "用 `moon test` 运行全部测试；提交 PR 前的完整步骤见[贡献指南](contributing.md)。"

#: manual/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "贡献指南"

#: manual/contributing.md:3
msgid "This guide collects the conventions for working on `luna-poly`. The Luna Flow organization rules apply on top of it."
msgstr "本指南汇集了参与 `luna-poly` 开发的约定。Luna Flow 组织规则在此之上同样适用。"

#: manual/contributing.md:5
msgid "Before a pull request"
msgstr "提交拉取请求之前"

#: manual/contributing.md:7
msgid "Run, from the repository (`./ready_to_pr.sh` runs `moon fmt`, `moon check`, `moon test` and `moon info`):"
msgstr "在仓库中运行（`./ready_to_pr.sh` 会运行 `moon fmt`、`moon check`、`moon test` 和 `moon info`）："

#: manual/contributing.md:16
msgid "Review the diff of every `pkg.generated.mbti`: it is the authority for the public API, and any change in it is an API change that the documentation and the changelog must reflect."
msgstr "审查每个 `pkg.generated.mbti` 的差异：它是公开 API 的权威来源，其中的任何变化都是 API 变化，文档和变更日志必须反映出来。"

#: manual/contributing.md:18
msgid "Code style"
msgstr "代码风格"

#: manual/contributing.md:20
msgid "Format with `moon fmt`; separate top-level items with `///|`."
msgstr "用 `moon fmt` 格式化；顶层项之间用 `///|` 分隔。"

#: manual/contributing.md:21
msgid "Use snake_case for bindings, functions, files and folders, and PascalCase for types and traits. Name files after what they implement (`sparse_polynomial.mbt`), not `utils.mbt`."
msgstr "绑定、函数、文件和文件夹使用 snake_case，类型和 trait 使用 PascalCase。文件按其实现的内容命名（`sparse_polynomial.mbt`），而不是 `utils.mbt`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:22
msgid "Keep explicit method promotions (`pub extend T with Trait::{...}`) in `extends.mbt`. Promote operators, `equal`, `compare`, `hash` and canonical `to_string`; keep other trait methods available only through the trait, and mark compatibility promotions `#deprecated` and `#doc(hidden)`."
msgstr "显式的方法提升（`pub extend T with Trait::{...}`）放在 `extends.mbt` 中。提升运算符、`equal`、`compare`、`hash` 和规范的 `to_string`；其他 trait 方法只通过 trait 提供，兼容性提升标记为 `#deprecated` 和 `#doc(hidden)`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:23
msgid "In blackbox tests, qualify names of the package under test (`@immut.DensePolynomial`); whitebox tests (`*_wbtest.mbt`) may use them unqualified."
msgstr "在黑盒测试中，被测包的名字要加限定（`@immut.DensePolynomial`）；白盒测试（`*_wbtest.mbt`）可以不加限定地使用它们。"

#: manual/contributing.md:25
msgid "Library conventions"
msgstr "库约定"

#: manual/contributing.md:27
msgid "**Canonical forms.** Every public operation returns canonical values: trimmed dense vectors, strictly descending merged term arrays, zero-free sparse maps. A new operation must restore the invariant before it returns."
msgstr "**规范形式。** 每个公开操作都返回规范值：修剪过的稠密向量、严格降序且已合并的项数组、不含零的稀疏映射。新操作必须在返回前恢复该不变量。"

#: manual/contributing.md:28
msgid "**Minimal bounds.** Each function asks only for the `luna-generic` capabilities it uses."
msgstr "**最小约束。** 每个函数只要求它所用到的 `luna-generic` 能力。"

#: manual/contributing.md:29
msgid "**Checked variants.** A partial operation has an aborting form and a `*_checked` form that returns `None` on contract violations. Abort messages name the violated contract."
msgstr "**带检查的变体。** 部分操作有一个会中止的形式，以及一个在违反契约时返回 `None` 的 `*_checked` 形式。中止消息要指出被违反的契约。"

#: manual/contributing.md:30
msgid "**Two layers.** Add an operation to `immut` first; add the mutable counterpart with the same name and parameter order, delegating to `immut` unless in-place storage gives a real benefit, and add a check to `src/consistency`. Document every intended difference in the [mutable design](design/mutable.md#api-symmetry-with-immut)."
msgstr "**两层。** 先在 `immut` 中添加操作；再以相同的名字和参数顺序添加可变版本，除非原地存储能带来实际好处，否则委托给 `immut`，并在 `src/consistency` 中添加检查。在 [mutable 设计](design/mutable.md#api-symmetry-with-immut)中记录每一处有意的差异。"

#: manual/contributing.md:31
msgid "**Mutation is named.** Only setters, `clear`, `add_term_inplace` and `*_inplace` methods may mutate their receiver."
msgstr "**变更须显式命名。** 只有 setter、`clear`、`add_term_inplace` 和 `*_inplace` 方法可以修改其接收者。"

#: manual/contributing.md:33
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: manual/contributing.md:35
msgid "The manual follows the Luna Flow documentation standard: English pages in `doc/manual` (one `api/`, `design/` and `tutorial/` page per package, named after the package path), Chinese and Japanese translations as gettext catalogs in `doc/locale`. After editing English pages, run `lunadoc update` and translate the new or fuzzy messages. Every runnable `moonbit` block must compile against the current code; mark intentional fragments `moonbit nocheck`."
msgstr "手册遵循 Luna Flow 文档标准：英文页面位于 `doc/manual`（每个包各有一个 `api/`、`design/` 和 `tutorial/` 页面，以包路径命名），中文和日文翻译以 gettext 目录的形式位于 `doc/locale`。编辑英文页面后，运行 `lunadoc update` 并翻译新的或模糊（fuzzy）的消息。每个可运行的 `moonbit` 代码块都必须能针对当前代码编译通过；有意保留的片段标记为 `moonbit nocheck`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:37
msgid "Commits"
msgstr "提交"

#: manual/contributing.md:39
msgid "Use Conventional Commits in English, `<type>(<scope>): <subject>`, with the package as scope (`fix(immut/context): ...`), one logical change per commit. If you are not a maintainer, ask before changing dependencies or the version in `moon.mod`."
msgstr "使用英文的 Conventional Commits，`<type>(<scope>): <subject>`，以包作为 scope（`fix(immut/context): ...`），每个提交只包含一个逻辑变更。如果你不是维护者，在修改依赖或 `moon.mod` 中的版本之前请先询问。"

#: manual/design/consistency.md:1
msgid "consistency design"
msgstr "consistency 设计"

