msgid "Mathematical background"
msgstr "数学背景"

#: manual/design/consistency.md:9
msgid "Each representation $\\rho$ (dense, term, sparse, context; immutable or mutable) comes with an interpretation $[\\![\\cdot]\\!]_\\rho$ into a polynomial ring. Consistency is the statement that every operation commutes with interpretation:"
msgstr "每种表示 $\\rho$（dense、term、sparse、context；不可变或可变）都带有一个到多项式环的解释 $[\\![\\cdot]\\!]_\\rho$。一致性是指每个操作都与解释可交换："

#: manual/design/consistency.md:15
msgid "and that conversions between representations preserve the interpretation. The tests check instances of these equations on concrete inputs."
msgstr "并且表示之间的转换保持解释不变。测试在具体输入上检查这些等式的实例。"

