msgstr "阅读路线"

#: manual/index.md:36
msgid "**New to the library.** Read the [immut tutorial](tutorial/immut.md), then the tutorial of the representation you need: [dense](tutorial/immut/dense.md) for one variable, [term](tutorial/immut/term.md) or [sparse](tutorial/immut/sparse.md) for several, [context](tutorial/immut/context.md) for named variables and substitution."
msgstr "**初次接触本库**。先读 [immut 教程](tutorial/immut.md)，再读你所需表示的教程：单变量读 [dense](tutorial/immut/dense.md)，多变量读 [term](tutorial/immut/term.md) 或 [sparse](tutorial/immut/sparse.md)，命名变量与代换读 [context](tutorial/immut/context.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:38
msgid "**Using it in an application.** Keep the [immut API](api/immut.md) and the per-representation API pages at hand; they state every precondition, failure case and cost. Read the [mutable tutorial](tutorial/mutable.md) when profiling shows that intermediate values matter."
msgstr "**在应用中使用**。把 [immut API](api/immut.md) 和各表示的 API 页面放在手边；它们列出了每个前置条件、失败情形和开销。当性能分析表明中间值很重要时，再阅读 [mutable 教程](tutorial/mutable.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:40
msgid "**Writing generic code or a new representation.** Read the [core tutorial](tutorial/core.md) and the [core design](design/core.md), which derives the monomial order and explains the capability traits and operation records."
msgstr "**编写泛型代码或新的表示**。阅读 [core 教程](tutorial/core.md) 和 [core 设计](design/core.md)，后者推导了单项式序，并解释了能力 trait 和操作记录。"

#: manual/index.md:42
msgid "**Contributing.** Read the [architecture guide](architecture.md), the design pages of the packages you touch, the [consistency](design/consistency.md) page, and the [contributing guide](contributing.md)."
msgstr "**参与贡献**。阅读[架构指南](architecture.md)、你所修改的包的设计页面、[consistency](design/consistency.md) 页面以及[贡献指南](contributing.md)。"

