msgstr "`luna-poly` 需要 `moonc` 0.10 或更高版本的 MoonBit 工具链。用以下命令将其添加到模块中"

#: manual/index.md:52
msgid "and import a facade in `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "并在 `moon.pkg` 中导入一个门面包："

#: manual/index.md:60
msgid "It depends on `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`, `Luna-Flow/arithmetic` and `Luna-Flow/type_theory`, which `moon` installs automatically."
msgstr "它依赖 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`、`Luna-Flow/arithmetic` 和 `Luna-Flow/type_theory`，`moon` 会自动安装它们。"

