#~ msgid "`immut` is the value-oriented layer of `luna-poly`. It models polynomials, exponent vectors, and multivariate term collections as canonical values."
#~ msgstr "`immut` 是 `luna-poly` 的值语义层。它把多项式、指数向量和多元项集合都建模为规范化值，适合作为普通数据在调用链中传递。"

#~ msgid "Responsibilities"
#~ msgstr "职责"

#~ msgid "Re-export shared `core` capability traits through the `immut` facade."
#~ msgstr "通过 `immut` facade 重新导出共享的 `core` 能力 trait。"

#~ msgid "Provide dense univariate `DensePolynomial[A]`."
#~ msgstr "提供单变量稠密多项式 `DensePolynomial[A]`。"

#~ msgid "Provide `ExponentVector` as a multivariate exponent key."
#~ msgstr "提供多元指数键 `ExponentVector`。"

#~ msgid "Provide two multivariate representations: sorted term sequence `TermPolynomial[A]` and ordered-map `SparsePolynomial[A]`."
#~ msgstr "提供两种多元多项式表示：排序项序列 `TermPolynomial[A]` 和有序映射 `SparsePolynomial[A]`。"

#~ msgid "Implement ordinary algebraic operations and `arithmetic.PowNatChecked` for polynomial types."
#~ msgstr "为三种多项式实现普通代数运算和 `arithmetic.PowNatChecked`。"

#~ msgid "Canonical Form"
#~ msgstr "规范形态"

#~ msgid "`DensePolynomial` stores coefficients in a core immutable vector, removes trailing zero coefficients, and represents zero as an empty vector."
#~ msgstr "`DensePolynomial` 使用 core immutable vector 保存系数，删除尾部零系数，零多项式存为空向量。"

#~ msgid "`ExponentVector` stores exponents in a core immutable vector, removes trailing zero exponents, and caches total degree."
#~ msgstr "`ExponentVector` 使用 core immutable vector 保存指数，删除尾部零指数，并缓存总次数。"

#~ msgid "`TermPolynomial` stores terms in a core immutable vector, merges equal exponents, removes zero coefficients, and keeps terms sorted."
#~ msgstr "`TermPolynomial` 使用 core immutable vector 保存项序列，合并相同指数项，删除零系数项，并保持内部项排序。"

#~ msgid "`SparsePolynomial` stores non-zero terms in a `SortedMap`; an empty map is zero."
#~ msgstr "`SparsePolynomial` 通过 `SortedMap` 保存非零项，空映射表示零多项式。"

#~ msgid "These rules are observable through `to_coefficients`, `to_terms`, `size`, `degree`, and equality."
#~ msgstr "这些规范化规则是可观察语义的一部分：`to_coefficients`、`to_terms`、`size`、`degree` 和相等性都依赖它们。"

#~ msgid "Public constructors copy input arrays. Update-like operations return new values, including:"
#~ msgstr "所有公开构造器都会复制输入数组。所有更新型操作都返回新值，例如："

#~ msgid "`+`, `-`, `*`, `scale`, and `pow`"
#~ msgstr "多项式的 `+`、`-`、`*`、`scale`、`pow`"

#~ msgid "Callers may safely reuse old values after any operation."
#~ msgstr "调用者可以安全复用旧值，不需要担心后续操作修改原对象。"

#~ msgid "Representation Differences"
#~ msgstr "表示差异"

#~ msgid "`TermPolynomial` and `SparsePolynomial` describe the same mathematical objects but optimize different access patterns:"
#~ msgstr "`TermPolynomial` 和 `SparsePolynomial` 描述同一类数学对象，但服务不同访问模式："

#~ msgid "`TermPolynomial` favors ordered traversal and batch algebraic operations over a canonical term sequence."
#~ msgstr "`TermPolynomial` 使用规范项序列，适合顺序遍历和批量代数运算。"

#~ msgid "`SparsePolynomial` favors lookup by `ExponentVector`."
#~ msgstr "`SparsePolynomial` 使用有序映射，适合按 `ExponentVector` 查询。"

#~ msgid "Convert explicitly with `SparsePolynomial::from_terms(term.to_terms())` or `TermPolynomial::from_terms(sparse.to_terms())`; conversion reapplies canonicalization without coupling implementation packages to each other."
#~ msgstr "两者通过 `SparsePolynomial::from_terms(term.to_terms())` 或 `TermPolynomial::from_terms(sparse.to_terms())` 显式互转，转换时重新应用规范化规则，同时避免实现子包相互依赖。"

#~ msgid "Capability Boundary"
#~ msgstr "能力边界"

#~ msgid "Algorithms that only need shared behavior should use `UnivariatePolynomial`, `MultivariatePolynomial`, or `ContextualPolynomial` instead of matching on a concrete storage type. When an algorithm needs construction or algebraic operations in addition to queries, accept the corresponding `Type::ops()` record and call its function fields."
#~ msgstr "只需要共享查询能力的算法应该依赖 `UnivariatePolynomial`、 `MultivariatePolynomial` 或 `ContextualPolynomial`，而不是匹配具体存储。如果算法还需要构造、转换或代数运算，则接收对应类型的 `Type::ops()` 记录。"

#~ msgid "`HasShape` and `PolynomialShape` provide the dimension layer expected by generic numeric code: univariate values report coefficient length, multivariate values report arity and term count, and contextual values report their `VariableContext` plus arity and term count. Shape compatibility is available through `PolynomialShape::is_compatible_with` and `compatible_checked`."
#~ msgstr "`HasShape` 与 `PolynomialShape` 提供泛型数值代码所需的维度层：单变量值报告系数长度，多变量值报告 arity 和项数，带上下文的值报告其 `VariableContext` 以及 arity 和项数。形状兼容性可以通过 `PolynomialShape::is_compatible_with` 和 `compatible_checked` 判断。"

#~ msgid "The facade re-exports common `luna-generic` algebra traits (`Zero`, `One`, `AddMonoid`, `MulMonoid`, `Semiring`, `Ring`, `Field`, and `Num`) so callers can write polynomial algorithms with the same capability vocabulary used by `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra`."
#~ msgstr "facade 重新导出常用的 `luna-generic` 代数 trait（`Zero`、`One`、`AddMonoid`、`MulMonoid`、`Semiring`、`Ring`、`Field` 和 `Num`），使调用者可以用与 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` 相同的能力词汇编写多项式算法。"

#~ msgid "Checked methods return `None` for caller contract failures such as negative powers, negative exponent-vector indexes, incomplete indexed evaluation, or context mismatch. Convenience methods keep the existing aborting behavior."
#~ msgstr "对于负幂次、负的指数向量索引、不完整的按索引求值或上下文不匹配等调用方契约失败，checked 方法返回 `None`。便捷方法保持既有的中止行为。"

#~ msgid "Substitution Boundary"
#~ msgstr "代换边界"

#~ msgid "Context-aware substitution uses `Luna-Flow/type_theory` names as the shared semantic naming layer. `luna-poly` still owns polynomial semantics: canonicalization, coefficient arithmetic, powers, sparse/term storage, and context compatibility are handled inside `ContextPolynomial`."
#~ msgstr "上下文感知代换使用 `Luna-Flow/type_theory` 名称作为共享的语义命名层。多项式语义仍归 `luna-poly` 所有：规范化、系数运算、幂运算、稀疏/排序项存储和上下文兼容性都在 `ContextPolynomial` 内部处理。"

#~ msgid "Substitution is simultaneous and one pass. A variable can be replaced by a scalar coefficient or by a same-context polynomial, but inserted replacement polynomials are not recursively substituted again in the same call. Partial evaluation is the scalar-only specialization and preserves the original `VariableContext` instead of projecting away assigned variables. Checked substitution rejects foreign variables, duplicate replacement entries, unknown `type_theory` names, and polynomial replacements from incompatible contexts."
#~ msgstr "代换是同时的一次性操作。变量可以被替换为标量系数或同一上下文中的多项式，但插入的替换多项式不会在同一次调用中再次被代换。部分求值是只针对标量的特化，它保留原有的 `VariableContext`，而不会投影掉已赋值的变量。checked 代换会拒绝外部变量、重复的替换条目、未知的 `type_theory` 名称以及来自不兼容上下文的替换多项式。"

