#~ msgstr "保持普通代数运算符的非原地语义。"

#~ msgid "Public methods that mutate the receiver include:"
#~ msgstr "可修改接收者的公开方法包括："

#~ msgid "Other ordinary operators and methods such as `scale`, `pow`, and `substitute` return new values."
#~ msgstr "其它普通运算符和 `scale`、`pow`、`substitute` 等方法返回新值，不修改接收者。"

#~ msgid "Relationship With immut"
#~ msgstr "与 immut 的关系"

#~ msgid "Many mutable operations convert through `immut` and then convert back. This keeps the two layers aligned on:"
#~ msgstr "`mutable` 中大量运算通过转换到 `immut` 后复用实现，再转换回来。这使两层在下列方面保持一致："

#~ msgid "trailing-zero removal for univariate polynomials,"
#~ msgstr "单变量多项式的尾部零删除规则。"

#~ msgid "exponent-vector canonicalization and degree semantics,"
#~ msgstr "多元指数向量的尾部零删除和总次数语义。"

#~ msgid "multivariate term merging and zero deletion,"
#~ msgstr "多元项合并、零项删除和求值语义。"

#~ msgid "natural-number exponentiation and `arithmetic.PowNatChecked`."
#~ msgstr "自然数幂和 `arithmetic.PowNatChecked` 行为。"

#~ msgid "`mutable.ExponentVector` is a wrapper around `immut.ExponentVector`; it remains value-oriented so it can be used as a stable key."
#~ msgstr "`mutable.ExponentVector` 本身是 `immut.ExponentVector` 的包装，并不是可原地修改的向量。它保持值语义，是为了作为可变多项式容器的稳定键。"

#~ msgid "Mutating operations must restore canonical form before returning:"
#~ msgstr "可变操作完成后必须恢复规范形态："

#~ msgid "`DensePolynomial` removes trailing zero coefficients."
#~ msgstr "`DensePolynomial` 删除尾部零系数。"

#~ msgid "`TermPolynomial` merges duplicate terms and removes zero coefficients."
#~ msgstr "`TermPolynomial` 合并重复项并删除零系数。"

#~ msgid "`SparsePolynomial` removes map entries whose coefficients become zero."
#~ msgstr "`SparsePolynomial` 删除系数变为零的映射项。"

#~ msgid "New in-place operations must preserve these invariants."
#~ msgstr "维护者添加新的原地操作时，必须在返回前恢复这些不变量。"

#~ msgid "Usage Boundary"
#~ msgstr "使用边界"

#~ msgid "Prefer `immut` by default. Use `mutable` when code needs step-by-step updates, fewer explicit intermediate values, or integration with an existing mutable algorithm."
#~ msgstr "默认优先使用 `immut`。当代码需要逐步更新、减少显式中间值，或与已有的可变算法对接时，再使用 `mutable`。"

#~ msgid "Generic code should depend on `UnivariatePolynomial`, `MultivariatePolynomial`, `ContextualPolynomial`, `MutablePolynomial`, or the relevant `Type::ops()` record instead of matching on a concrete mutable storage type."
#~ msgstr "泛型代码应依赖 `UnivariatePolynomial`、`MultivariatePolynomial`、`ContextualPolynomial`、`MutablePolynomial` 或相应的 `Type::ops()` 记录，而不是匹配具体的可变存储类型。"

#~ msgid "Mutable containers also implement `HasShape`, so execution-oriented algorithms can inspect the same `PolynomialShape` metadata as immutable code. The mutable facade re-exports the `luna-generic` algebra traits used by the linear-algebra package, and mutable `Type::ops()` records expose construction, addition, multiplication, evaluation, scaling, and powers for generic algorithms."
#~ msgstr "可变容器同样实现 `HasShape`，因此执行导向的算法可以查看与不可变代码相同的 `PolynomialShape` 元数据。mutable facade 重新导出线性代数包所用的 `luna-generic` 代数 trait，可变的 `Type::ops()` 记录为泛型算法提供构造、加法、乘法、求值、缩放和幂运算。"

#~ msgid "Checked methods mirror the immutable layer and return `None` for contract failures. Existing convenience methods remain aborting wrappers."
#~ msgstr "checked 方法与不可变层一一对应，在契约失败时返回 `None`。已有的便捷方法仍是会中止的包装。"

#~ msgid "Mutable context substitution delegates to the immutable context model. Mutable wrappers expose the same scalar/polynomial substitution and partial-evaluation APIs, but the canonical result is produced by the immutable implementation and then wrapped back into `mutable.ContextPolynomial`. The same checked failure contracts apply: foreign variables, duplicate assignments, unknown `type_theory` names, and incompatible replacement polynomial contexts return `None`."
#~ msgstr "可变上下文代换委托给不可变上下文模型。可变包装提供相同的标量/多项式代换和部分求值 API，但规范结果由不可变实现生成，再包装回 `mutable.ContextPolynomial`。同样的 checked 失败契约依然适用：外部变量、重复赋值、未知 `type_theory` 名称以及上下文不兼容的替换多项式都返回 `None`。"

#~ msgid "`luna-poly` provides canonical polynomial types for MoonBit with explicit immutable and mutable execution models. This manual describes version 0.2.0."
#~ msgstr "`luna-poly` 为 MoonBit 提供规范化的多项式类型，并明确区分不可变与可变两种执行模型。本手册描述 0.2.0 版本。"

#~ msgid "The library has one shared capability layer and two explicit execution models:"
#~ msgstr "本库由一个共享能力层和两种执行模型组成："

#~ msgid "`core` provides shared types, capability traits, and functional operation records."
#~ msgstr "`core` 提供共享类型、能力 trait 和函数式操作记录。"

#~ msgid "`immut` provides persistent value semantics."
#~ msgstr "`immut` 提供持久化值语义，更新返回新值。"

#~ msgid "`mutable` provides explicit setters and `_inplace` operations."
#~ msgstr "`mutable` 提供 setter 与命名清晰的 `_inplace` 原地操作。"

#~ msgid "Concrete implementations live in mirrored subpackages:"
#~ msgstr "具体实现位于镜像子包中："

#~ msgid "The top-level `immut` and `mutable` packages are facades that re-export core capabilities plus their concrete implementations. Both facades expose dense univariate, sorted-term multivariate, and ordered-map sparse polynomials. Canonical form and natural-power behavior are shared across both packages."
#~ msgstr "顶层 `immut` 和 `mutable` 是 facade 包，会重新导出 `core` 能力和对应的具体实现。两个 facade 都提供单变量稠密多项式、排序项多元多项式和有序映射稀疏多项式。两个包共享规范形态和自然数幂语义。"

#~ msgid "The 0.2.0 package layout is intentionally source-incompatible with the former root package. Import `/immut` or `/mutable` explicitly."
#~ msgstr "0.2.0 的包布局有意与以前的根包在源码层面不兼容。请显式导入 `/immut` 或 `/mutable`。"

#~ msgid "Representations"
#~ msgstr "表示"

#~ msgid "Both packages provide `DensePolynomial`, `TermPolynomial`, `SparsePolynomial`, `ExponentVector`, and context-aware polynomial helpers. Dense polynomials use ascending coefficient arrays; `TermPolynomial` uses a sorted term array; `SparsePolynomial` uses an ordered map. Every representation removes zero terms and maintains a canonical form."
#~ msgstr "两个包都提供 `DensePolynomial`、`TermPolynomial`、`SparsePolynomial`、`ExponentVector` 以及上下文感知的多项式辅助类型。稠密多项式使用升幂系数数组；`TermPolynomial` 使用排序项数组；`SparsePolynomial` 使用有序映射。每种表示都会删除零项并保持规范形态。"

#~ msgid "Natural powers implement `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.PowNatChecked`. The convenience `pow(UInt)` methods use the same semantics: exponent zero returns the multiplicative identity, including for the zero polynomial."
#~ msgstr "自然数幂实现 `Luna-Flow/arithmetic.PowNatChecked`。便捷方法 `pow(UInt)` 使用相同语义：指数为零时返回乘法单位元，零多项式也不例外。"

#~ msgid "`Variable` and `VariableContext` provide the named-variable layer. A `ContextPolynomial` binds a variable context to either term-array or sparse storage, supports both indexed and named evaluation, and exposes checked variants for context or assignment failures."
#~ msgstr "`Variable` 与 `VariableContext` 提供命名变量层。`ContextPolynomial` 把变量上下文绑定到排序项数组或稀疏存储，同时支持按索引和按名称求值，并为上下文或赋值失败提供 checked 变体。"

#~ msgid "Context-aware polynomials integrate with `Luna-Flow/type_theory` names for substitution-facing APIs. `Variable::to_type_theory_name` and `VariableContext::variable_by_type_theory_name` bridge polynomial variables to the shared semantic substrate. `ContextPolynomial::substitute_checked` replaces variables with scalars or same-context polynomials, while `eval_partial_checked` is the scalar-only partial-evaluation specialization. These operations preserve polynomial-owned canonicalization; `type_theory` provides the shared naming and substitution vocabulary, not polynomial storage or normalization."
#~ msgstr "上下文感知多项式通过 `Luna-Flow/type_theory` 名称接入面向代换的 API。`Variable::to_type_theory_name` 和 `VariableContext::variable_by_type_theory_name` 把多项式变量桥接到共享的语义基础层。`ContextPolynomial::substitute_checked` 把变量替换为标量或同一上下文中的多项式，而 `eval_partial_checked` 是只针对标量的部分求值特化。这些操作保留由多项式负责的规范化；`type_theory` 提供共享的命名与代换词汇，而不负责多项式存储或规范化。"

#~ msgid "Use `UnivariatePolynomial`, `MultivariatePolynomial`, `ContextualPolynomial`, and `MutablePolynomial` when an algorithm only needs a capability boundary. Use `Type::ops()` records when functional-style generic code needs construction, conversion, or algebraic operations without matching on the storage representation."
#~ msgstr "当算法只需要能力边界时，使用 `UnivariatePolynomial`、`MultivariatePolynomial`、`ContextualPolynomial` 和 `MutablePolynomial`。当函数式泛型代码需要构造、转换或代数运算，又不想匹配存储表示时，使用 `Type::ops()` 记录。"

#~ msgid "The shared `core` layer also exposes lightweight shape metadata through `PolynomialShape` and `HasShape`. Generic code can inspect univariate length, multivariate arity and term count, or context compatibility before combining values. Checked APIs such as `coefficient_checked`, `scale_checked`, `eval_checked`, substitution, and context `*_checked` methods return `None` for contract failures; the shorter convenience methods abort instead."
#~ msgstr "共享的 `core` 层还通过 `PolynomialShape` 和 `HasShape` 提供轻量的形状元数据。泛型代码可以在组合值之前查看单变量长度、多变量 arity 与项数，或上下文兼容性。`coefficient_checked`、`scale_checked`、`eval_checked`、代换以及上下文 `*_checked` 方法等 checked API 在契约失败时返回 `None`；较短的便捷方法则会中止。"

#~ msgid "The `immut` and `mutable` facades re-export the common algebra traits from `Luna-Flow/luna-generic`, including `Zero`, `One`, `AddMonoid`, `MulMonoid`, `Semiring`, `Ring`, `Field`, and `Num`, so polynomial APIs can be used with the same capability style as `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra`."
#~ msgstr "`immut` 和 `mutable` facade 重新导出 `Luna-Flow/luna-generic` 中的常用代数 trait，包括 `Zero`、`One`、`AddMonoid`、`MulMonoid`、`Semiring`、`Ring`、`Field` 和 `Num`，因此可以用与 `Luna-Flow/linear-algebra` 相同的能力风格使用多项式 API。"

